ode"],["経験者向けモード","Experienced mode","Experienced mode"],["\\C[24]無敵でプレイする（推奨）","\\C[24] Play as invincible (recommended)","\\C[24] Play as invincible (recommended)"],["無敵でプレイしない","Don't play invincible","Don't play invincible"],["------------------------------------\nここよりサダカヤ編用","------------------------------------\nFrom here for Sadakaya version",""],["------------------------------------\n■オプション選択可能時のアナウンス","------------------------------------\n■Announcement when options can be selected",""],["\\>　　　　このプレイでは、メニュー画面の「オプション」から\n\\>　　　　様々な要素を切り替えることが可能です。","\\>　　　　　In this play, from \"Options\" on the menu screen\n\\> It is possible to switch various elements.","\\>　　　　　In this play, from \"Options\" on the menu screen\n\\> It is possible to switch various elements."],["--------------------\n■画面の色調変更\n※ここ以外では外に出入りする場合と\nパズル開始終了時以外変更しません。","--------------------\n■Change screen color tone\n*If you go outside other than here,\nIt is not changed except at the beginning and end of the puzzle.",""],["--------------------\n■色変更処理","--------------------\n■Color change processing",""],["--------------------\n■青の位置が上記以外の時","--------------------\n■When the blue position is other than the above",""],["---------------------------------------------\nＩＣカード持っていないときは\nヒントが出る","---------------------------------------------\nWhen you don't have an IC card\nGet a hint",""],["\\n<\\N[2]>紙切れの穴のサイズが\n台に現れた青い丸の大きさと似ているのが\n気になりますね……。","\\n<\\N[2]> The size of the hole in the piece of paper is\nThe size of the blue circle that appeared on the table is similar to that of\nI'm curious....","\\n<\\N[2]> The size of the hole in the piece of paper is\nThe size of the blue circle that appeared on the table is similar to that of\nI'm curious...."],["--------------------\n■通常の場合","--------------------\n■ Normal case",""],["\\n<\\N[2]>『タリスマンは月、星、太陽があり\nそれぞれ異なる人物に作用する\nその者が該当するタリスマンを身に付ければ\n何らかの災厄から守られるだろう』","\\n<\\N[2]> 『Talisman has moon, stars, and sun.\neach affects a different person\nIf that person wears the corresponding talisman,\nIt will protect you from some kind of disaster.''","\\n<\\N[2]>\"There are amulets which resemble Moon, Star, and Sun.\nEach one affects a different kind of person.\nIf such a person wears the corresponding amulet,\nthey will be protected from certain disasters.\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>……どうやらタリスマンには\n科学を超えた力があるようですね……\\!\n化け物のいること自体、科学で解明できない今\n私はタリスマンの力を信じましょう","\\n<\\N[2]>... Apparently the talisman\nIt seems like there is a power beyond science...\\!\nNowadays, the existence of monsters cannot be explained by science.\nI believe in the power of talismans","\\n<\\N[2]>...This book claims these amulets have a power that\ngoes beyond science...\\!\nGiven the very existence of the monster is already beyond science,\nI may be forced to accept the power of these amulets."],["「○回連続で死なずに逃げ切る」の判定用ルーチンです。\n敵から逃げ切った時に呼び出されます。\n--------------------","This is a routine for determining \"Escape without dying XX times in a row.\"\nCalled when you have successfully escaped from an enemy.\n--------------------",""],["青鬼初登場を逃げ切った時に呼び出されます。\n----------------------------------------","Called when you successfully escape the first appearance of the blue demon.\n----------------------------------------",""],["通常シナリオをクリアした際に呼び出されます。\nタイミングは、スタッフロール直前です。\nこのイベントから、様々なアチーブメントを呼びだします。\n----------------------------------------","Normally called when the scenario is cleared.\nThe timing is just before the staff roll.\nVarious achievements will be triggered from this event.\n----------------------------------------",""],["アチーブメントの際は、\nピクチャの1番にblackのファイルで暗転を行います。\nこのため、ピクチャは2番以降をお使いください。","For achievements,\nDarken the first picture using the black file.\nFor this reason, please use picture number 2 or later.","For achievements,\nDarken the first picture using the black file.\nFor this reason, please use picture number 2 or later."],["----------------------------------------\n■○歩以内クリア","----------------------------------------\n■Clear within ○ steps",""],["----------------------------------------\n■○分以内クリア\n「時間」は最後の青鬼を振り切った時の経過秒数です。\n例：30分なら1800","----------------------------------------\n■Cleared within ○ minutes\n\"Time\" is the number of seconds that have passed since you shook off the last blue demon.\nExample: 1800 for 30 minutes",""],["----------------------------------------\n■○人救出","----------------------------------------\n■○ person rescue",""],["----------------------------------------\n■速度２倍でクリア","----------------------------------------\n■Clear at double speed",""],["コミカルモード（通称ひろしくんモード）クリア時に\n呼び出されます。\nタイミングは、タイトル画面に戻る直前です。\n----------------------------------------","Upon clearing comical mode (commonly known as Hiroshi-kun mode)\nwill be called.\nThe timing is just before returning to the title screen.\n----------------------------------------",""],["AndAppAchievement update clear_comical","AndAppAchievement update clear_comical",""],["ハッカドール編クリア時に\n呼び出されます。\nタイミングは、タイトル画面に戻る直前です。\n----------------------------------------","When clearing the Hacka Doll edition\nwill be called.\nThe timing is just before returning to the title screen.\n----------------------------------------",""],["AndAppAchievement update clear_hackadoll","AndAppAchievement update clear_hackadoll",""],["AndAppAchievement update clear_3000_steps","AndAppAchievement update clear_3000_steps",""],["AndAppAchievement update clear_4000_steps","AndAppAchievement update clear_4000_steps",""],["AndAppAchievement update clear_5000_steps","AndAppAchievement update clear_5000_steps",""],["初めてこの回数連続で逃げ切った時に１度だけ表示されます\n----------------------------------------","It will only be displayed once when you escape this number of times in a row for the first time.\n----------------------------------------",""],["AndAppAchievement update escape_20_time_continuously","AndAppAchievement update escape_20_time_continuously",""],["AndAppAchievement update escape_10_time_continuously","AndAppAchievement update escape_10_time_continuously",""],["AndAppAchievement update escape_5_time_continuously","AndAppAchievement update escape_5_time_continuously",""],["AndAppAchievement update escape_1_time_continuously","AndAppAchievement update escape_1_time_continuously",""],["AndAppAchievement update clear_in_15_minutes","AndAppAchievement update clear_in_15_minutes",""],["AndAppAchievement update clear_in_30_minutes","AndAppAchievement update clear_in_30_minutes",""],["AndAppAchievement update clear_in_60_minutes","AndAppAchievement update clear_in_60_minutes",""],["AndAppAchievement update clear_in_90_minutes","AndAppAchievement update clear_in_90_minutes",""],["AndAppAchievement update rescue_all","AndAppAchievement update rescue_all",""],["AndAppAchievement update rescue_two","AndAppAchievement update rescue_two",""],["AndAppAchievement update rescue_one","AndAppAchievement update rescue_one",""],["AndAppAchievement update clear_in_twice_speed","AndAppAchievement update clear_in_twice_speed",""],["クリア時間\n\\V[45]:\\V[46]:\\V[47]","clear time\n\\V[45]:\\V[46]:\\V[47]","CLEAR TIME\n\\V[45]:\\V[46]:\\V[47]"],["\\n<\\N[2]>主人公の名前を\\C[2]ｎｏｐｒｏｐｓ\\C[0]にすると……","\\n<\\N[2]>If the main character's name is \\C[2]noprops\\C[0]...","\\n<\\N[2]>If you set the main character's name\nto \\C[2]ｎｏｐｒｏｐｓ\\C[0]..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>主人公の名前を\\C[2]サスケ\\C[0]にすると……","\\n<\\N[2]> If the main character's name is \\C[2] Sasuke \\C[0]...","\\n<\\N[2]>If you set the main character's name\nto \\C[2]サスケ\\C[0]..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>主人公の名前を\\C[2]ふうきゅう\\C[0]にすると……","\\n<\\N[2]>If the main character's name is \\C[2]fuukyu\\C[0]...","\\n<\\N[2]>If you set the main character's name\nto \\C[2]ふうきゅう\\C[0]..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>主人公の名前を\\C[2]ｎｏｐｒｏｐｓ\\C[0]にすると……\nまたは\\C[2]サスケ\\C[0]にすると……\nまたは\\C[2]ふうきゅう\\C[0]にすると……","\\n<\\N[2]>If the main character's name is \\C[2]noprops\\C[0]...\nOr \\C[2] Sasuke \\C[0]...\nOr if you set \\C[2] to \\C[0]...","\\n<\\N[2]>If you set the main character's name\nto \\C[2]noprops\\C[0]...\nOr \\C[2]サスケ\\C[0]...\nOr if you set it to \\C[2]ふうきゅう\\C[0]..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>主人公の名前を\\C[2]ヒカットール\\C[0]にすると……","\\n<\\N[2]> If the main character's name is \\C[2] Hikattor \\C[0]...","\\n<\\N[2]>If you set the main character's name\nto \\C[2]ヒカットール\\C[0]..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>主人公の名前を\\C[2]ヒロシ\\C[0]にすると……","\\n<\\N[2]> If the main character's name is \\C[2] Hiroshi \\C[0]...","\\n<\\N[2]>If you set the main character's name to\n\\C[2]ヒロシ\\C[0]..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>主人公の名前を\\C[2]タイマー\\C[0]にすると……","\\n<\\N[2]> If the main character's name is \\C[2] timer \\C[0]...","\\n<\\N[2]>If you set the main character's name\nto \\C[2]タイマー\\C[0]..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>主人公の名前を\\C[2]むてき\\C[0]にすると……","\\n<\\N[2]>If you change the main character's name to \\C[2] and \\C[0]...","\\n<\\N[2]>If you set the main character's name\nto \\C[2]むてき\\C[0]..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>主人公の名前を\\C[2]コミカル\\C[0]にすると……\nまた\\C[2]コミカルムテキ\\C[0]にすると……","\\n<\\N[2]> If the main character's name is \\C[2] Comical \\C[0]...\nAlso, if you change it to \\C[2] Comical Muteki \\C[0]...","\\n<\\N[2]>If you set the main character's name\nto \\C[2]コミカル\\C\\C[0]...\nOr if you set it to \\C[2]コミカルムテキ\\C[0]..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>主人公の名前を\\C[2]フワッティー\\C[0]にすると……","\\n<\\N[2]>If the main character's name is \\C[2]Fwatty \\C[0]...","\\n<\\N[2]>If you set the main character's name\nto \\C[2]フワッティー\\C[0]..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>主人公の名前を\\C[2]ばいそく\\C[0]にすると……\nまた\\C[2]ばいそくむてき\\C[0]にすると……","\\n<\\N[2]> If the main character's name is \\C[2] and \\C[0]...\nAlso, if you change it to \\C[2] and \\C[0]...","\\n<\\N[2]>If you set the main character's name\nto \\C[2]ばいそく\\C[0]...\nOr if you set it to \\C[2]ばいそくむてき\\C[0]..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>主人公の名前を\\C[2]キノシタ\\C[0]にすると……","\\n<\\N[2]> If the main character's name is \\C[2] Kinoshita \\C[0]...","\\n<\\N[2]>If you set the main character's name\nto \\C[2]キノシタ\\C[0]..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>主人公の名前を\\C[2]ハッカドール\\C[0]にすると……\nまた\\C[2]ハッカムテキ\\C[0]にすると……","\\n<\\N[2]> If the main character's name is \\C[2] Hacka Doll \\C[0]...\nAlso, if you change it to \\C[2] Hackam Text \\C[0]...","\\n<\\N[2]>If you set the main character's name\nto \\C[2]ハッカドール\\C[0]...\nOr if you set it to \\C[2]ハッカムテキ\\C[0]..."],["-------------------------------------\n月のタリスマン関連追記。\n入手したが、美香に渡さなかったときに表示。\n最後の沈黙は、ここでは美香が亡くなっているため。","-------------------------------------\nAdditional notes related to the Moon Talisman.\nDisplayed when you obtained it but did not give it to Mika.\nThe final silence is because Mika is dead here.",""],["\\n<\\N[2]>月のタリスマンのタンス回避効果は、\n単純所持で２倍、\n美香さんが所持し、同行していた場合は\n５倍だったそうです。","\\n<\\N[2]> Moon Talisman's chest avoidance effect is\nDouble for simple possession,\nIf Mika is in her possession and accompanying her,\nApparently it was 5 times more.","\\n<\\N[2]>The Moon Amulet doubles my chances of avoiding\ncatastrophes just by holding it.\nIf Mika was the one holding it, and she was with me,\nthe chances would have been quintupled."],["\\n<\\N[2]>………………………………。","\\n<\\N[2]>……………………………….","\\n<\\N[2]>..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>手帳を読み返す","\\n<\\N[2]>Reread the notebook","\\n<\\N[2]>Reread the notebook."],["メモ１","Memo 1",""],["メモ２","Memo 2",""],["メモ３","Memo 3",""],["メモ４","Memo 4",""],["手帳を閉じる","close the notebook",""],["\\n<\\N[2]>『私たち家族は道なき道を経て、\n最後に神のもとにたどり着いた』","\\n<\\N[2]> “Our family has gone through a pathless path,\nI finally reached God.''","\\n<\\N[2]>\"Our family went down a path none had yet known,\nand at it's end, we reached God.\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>『神のもとへの道のりは、神が傍に立っておられれば、\nすぐに分かったことだろうが……』","\\n<\\N[2]> “The path to God is as long as God is standing by your side.\nI guess you found out right away...''","\\n<\\N[2]>\"Had God been standing by my side,\nthe path to Him surely would have been clearer...\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>『それでも私たちは、\n神にすがるより他はないのだから……』","\\n<\\N[2]> ``Still, we...\nThere is nothing else to do but cling to God...''","\\n<\\N[2]>\"And yet,\nwe have no choice but to cling to God...\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>神が傍らにいるなら、\nわざわざ赴く必要もないはずですが。\\!\nこれも何かの仕掛けのヒントでしょうか……？","\\n<\\N[2]>If God is by your side,\nThere shouldn't be any need to go out of your way. \\!\nIs this also a hint of some kind of trick...?","\\n<\\N[2]>If God is right by your side, there should\nbe no need to go out of your way to visit a specific place....\\!\nCould this be a hint regarding some sort of mechanism...?"],["\\n<\\N[2]>『試行錯誤を経て、２つの出口が開くときがある』","\\n<\\N[2]> “Through trial and error, there are times when two exits open.”","\\n<\\N[2]>\"Trial and error sometimes leads to two exits opening up.”"],["\\n<\\N[2]>『片方はすぐに逃げ出せるところにあるが……』","\\n<\\N[2]> \"One side is in a place where you can quickly escape, but...\"","\\n<\\N[2]>\"One is in a position to be escaped through immediately...\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>『もう片方は魑魅魍魎の巣の中にあるそうだ』","\\n<\\N[2]> ``The other one is said to be inside the nest of Chimi Mōrō.''","\\n<\\N[2]>\"The other is said to be within the monster's den.\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>『化け物の正体を突き止め、\n希望を取り戻さない限り、\n結局は堂々巡りなのだという……』","\\n<\\N[2]> “We will find out the true identity of the monster,\nUnless we regain hope,\nIn the end, it's all a matter of course...''","\\n<\\N[2]>\"It is said that unless we steel ourselves,\nand discover the monster's true nature,\nthe cycle will only continue...\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>『私に余力があり、\nふと化け物たちが出払うときがあれば\nそちらの出口の方を試したいものだが……』","\\n<\\N[2]> “I have extra energy,\nIf the monsters suddenly come out\nI'd like to try that exit, but...''","\\n<\\N[2]>\"If I could muster the energy,\nand if there came a moment where the monsters went missing,\nI would like to try that exit...\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>『家は人なり』","\\n<\\N[2]> “Home is people”","\\n<\\N[2]>\"A house is those who live in it.\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>『大事なものが、あるべきところにない』","\\n<\\N[2]> “Something important is not where it should be.”","\\n<\\N[2]>\"Something important is not where it should be.\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>『いや、何が大事なのかさえ分からなくなってしまった』","\\n<\\N[2]> “No, I don’t even know what’s important anymore.”","\\n<\\N[2]>\"No, I don’t even know what’s important anymore.\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>『いつのまにか、自分で自分を迷宮にしてしまう』","\\n<\\N[2]> “Before you know it, you will turn yourself into a labyrinth.”","\\n<\\N[2]>\"Before you know it, you'll have become a labyrinth yourself.\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>『いつしか化け物まで棲み着くありさまだ』","\\n<\\N[2]> “Even monsters will live here before you know it.”","\\n<\\N[2]>\"Then monsters will come to live in it.\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>『それとも、私の不安や混乱が化け物になったのか』","\\n<\\N[2]> “Or maybe my anxiety and confusion have turned into a monster?”","\\n<\\N[2]>\"Or maybe the monsters will be your own insanity?\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>『わからない……』","\\n<\\N[2]> \"I don't understand...\"","\\n<\\N[2]>\"I don't understand...\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>『家は私自身だ……』","\\n<\\N[2]> \"My home is mine...\"","\\n<\\N[2]>\"My home is as I am...\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>『私には、誰かの希望（たすけ）が必要だ……』","\\n<\\N[2]> \"I need someone's hope...\"","\\n<\\N[2]>\"I desperately need help...\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>『道具（もの）は必要とされることで\n　道具（きぼう）となる』","\\n<\\N[2]> ``Tools (things) are needed because they are needed.\nBecome a tool.''","\\n<\\N[2]>\"Some things can become a source of hope\nwhen you need them.\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>『人（もの）も然り……』","\\n<\\N[2]> “The same goes for people (things)…”","\\n<\\N[2]>\"The same can be true of people...\""],["\\n<\\N[2]>座金と古びた金属棒を組み合わせる","\\n<\\N[2]> Combine washer and old metal rod","\\n<\\N[2]>Combine Washer and Weathered Metal Rod."],["\\n<\\N[2]>座金と祭壇がつながっていた部分に、\nこの金属棒がピタリと収まりました。\\!\nまた、鍵がひとつできたようですが……","\\n<\\N[2]>In the part where the washer and the altar were connected,\nThis metal rod fit perfectly. \\!\nAlso, it seems that one key has been created...","\\n<\\N[2]>The Weathered Metal Rod fit perfectly into the hole that\nkept the washer on the altar.\\!\nAlso, it seems they have combined into a key..."],["---------------------------------------------\n\nアイテム合体演出","---------------------------------------------\n\nItem combination production",""],["---------------------------------------------","---------------------------------------------",""],["-------------------------------------------","-------------------------------------------",""],["\\n<たけし>館で手に入れた持ち物が、\n座金の中で合体しちまった！？ \\!\n緑色の宝石に……","\\n<たけし>The belongings obtained at the building are\nIt has merged inside the washer! ? \\!\nA green gem...","\\n<Takeshi>The items we got in the mansion\nhave merged into the washer!?\\!\nThey've become a green gem..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>こんな現象が目の前で起こるとは……","\\n<\\N[2]> I never thought a phenomenon like this would happen right in front of my eyes...","\\n<\\N[2]>I never thought I'd see something quite like this..."],["\\n<美香>キレイね……。\\.\\.\\.\nそれ、私たちの持っているお守りと、\n同じものじゃない？","\\n<美香>It's beautiful... \\.\\.\\.\nThat's the amulet we have,\nIsn't it the same thing?","\\n<Mika>It's beautiful...\\.\\.\\.\nDoesn't it seem a lot\nlike our amulets?"],["\\n<卓郎>しかも鍵付きだ。\\.\\.どこで使うんだろうな？","\\n<卓郎> And it comes with a key. I wonder where \\.\\. is used?","\\n<Takuro>It looks like it's a key, too.\\.\\. What could it be for?"],["\\n<\\N[2]>そういえば……。\\.\\.\nこの舘で、まだ開けていない扉がひとつだけ、\nあったはずです。","\\n<\\N[2]>Now that I think about it... \\.\\.\nThere's only one door in this mansion that hasn't been opened yet.\nThere should have been.","\\n<\\N[2]>Come to think about it...\\.\\.\nThere's only one door in this mansion\nthat we've yet to open."],["\\n<たけし>でも、さっき開けたドアから出ればいいんじゃないか？\\!\n青いピースを３つはめた部屋にあった、あのドアから……","\\n<たけし> But shouldn't I just go out through the door I opened earlier? \\!\nFrom that door in the room with three blue pieces...","\\n<Takeshi>But couldn't we just go out the door we opened earlier?\\!\nYou know, the one where we put the three blue pieces..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>先ほど井戸から出ようとして\n化け物に阻まれた経緯もあります。\n同じ出るのであれば……","\\n<\\N[2]> I was just trying to get out of the well.\nThere is also a history of being blocked by monsters.\nIf it comes out the same...","\\n<\\N[2]>Only a little while ago, the monster destroyed the ladder\nwe could've used to leave by climbing out of the well.\nIf we're going to make it out..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>この、４つめのタリスマンとも考えられる鍵を試す方に\n賭けた方がよいかもしれませんが、どうでしょう。","\\n<\\N[2]>For those trying this key, which can be considered as the fourth talisman.\nMight be a good bet, but guess what?","\\n<\\N[2]>This key seems like a 4th amulet.\nI think the key it forms is a better bet. What do you say?"],["\\n<\\N[2]>皆の同意を得て、緑の鍵を握りしめた。","\\n<\\N[2]>With everyone's consent, I grabbed the green key.","\\n<\\N[2]>With everyone's approval, I found the item, \"Green Key\"."],["\\n<美香>残ったのはＩＣカードにくっついていた写真だけね。\\!\nこれだけ実物だったのかしら……？","\\n<美香>The only thing left is the photo stuck to the IC card. \\!\nI wonder if it was all that real...?","\\n<Mika>The only thing left is the photo from the contactless card.\\!\nWas it the only real thing...?"],["\\n<\\N[2]>写真をポケットにしまった。","\\n<\\N[2]> I put the photo in my pocket.","\\n<\\N[2]>I put the photo in my pocket."],["ゲームオーバー時の録画終了処理を記述してください。\n画面表示開始とともに実行されます。\n----------------------------------------","Please describe the recording termination process when the game is over.\nExecuted when the screen starts displaying.\n----------------------------------------",""],["AndAppCapture finish game_over","AndAppCapture finish game_over",""],["-----------------------------------\n左上↑にいるときの処理","-----------------------------------\nProcessing when in the upper left ↑",""],["AooniKayakoHouseProcess 1","AooniKayakoHouseProcess 1",""],["AooniKayakoHouseProcess 2","AooniKayakoHouseProcess 2",""],["AooniKayakoHouseProcess X","AooniKayakoHouseProcess X",""],["------------------------------------\n和室１のみで使用","------------------------------------\nUsed only in Japanese room 1",""],["\\n<珠緒>経蔵のせいだ……。","\\n<珠緒> It's because of the sutra...",""],["\\n<経蔵>……お前のワガママをかなえようとした結果だ。\nしかたがない。\\!\nま。気の済むまでボヤいてな。\\.\\.生きてる証拠だ。","\\n<経蔵>...This is the result of trying to fulfill your selfish desires.\nI have no choice. \\!\nMa. Just keep complaining until you get bored. \\.\\.It's proof that you're alive.",""],["経蔵さんは言葉とは裏腹に\n「生きててよかったな」と軽くなぐさめた\nように見受けられた。","Contrary to what Keizo says,\n\"I'm glad you're alive,\" he comforted me lightly.\nIt seemed that way.",""],["\\n<珠緒>経蔵のせいなんだからね……！\\!\n……ぐすっ。","\\n<珠緒> It's because of the Kyozo...! \\!\n...Good.",""],["伽椰子","Kayako",""],["化け物背後に出現","Appears behind the monster",""],["\\^","\\^",""],["記述１","Description 1",""],["記述２","Description 2",""],["記述３","Description 3",""],["記述４","Description 4",""],["記述５","Description 5",""],["ノートを閉じる","close note",""],["この日、佐伯と名乗る母子が我が家を訪ねてきた。\n話によると、最近自宅を失ったという。","On this day, a mother and child who called themselves Saeki came to visit our house.\nAccording to the story, he recently lost his home.",""],["部屋は十分にあったので、新居が見つかるまで２階の、\nベッドが２つある部屋を貸すことにした。","We had enough rooms, so we stayed on the second floor until we found a new home.\nI decided to rent a room with two beds.",""],["あいにくと、彼女たちが連れていた悪意は、\n我が家に棲む悪意と折り合いがよくないようだ。","Unfortunately, the malice they carried with them,\nI don't seem to be able to come to terms with the malice that lives in my home.",""],["自らの悪意や、それについてまわる悪意に自由を縛られる悩みは、\nお互い変わらぬようだ。","The trouble of having your freedom tied to your own malice and the malice surrounding it,\nIt seems that they are no different from each other.",""],["山村という女性が訪ねてきた。\\!\n彼女もまた、怨霊となった自らの悪意やそれを抱き込む\n強大な悪意とともにいて、それに悩む者だった。","A woman named Yamamura came to visit. \\!\nShe also embraces her own malice that has become a vengeful spirit.\nHe lived with great malice and was troubled by it.",""],["同類である私のことをどこからか知って訪ねてきたという。\\!\nここのところ、客人との縁が多い。","He heard about me from somewhere and came to visit me. \\!\nThese days, I have many connections with guests.",""],["残念ながら私も山村も、悪意と正面から戦うだけの力はない。\\!\n生ある訪問者が悪意に追われているさなかに、\nできるだけ悪意の気をそらしたり、","Unfortunately, neither I nor Yamamura have the strength to fight against evil intentions head-on. \\!\nIn the midst of a lively visitor being chased by malicious intent,\nto distract the evil spirits as much as possible,",""],["床に矢印などの模様を浮かび上がらせることぐらいだ。\\!\nただ残念ながら、今の私たちの力では、\nある程度霊視できる者にだけ見える程度のものしか出せない。","It's all about making arrows and other patterns appear on the floor. \\!\nUnfortunately, with our current strength,\nIt can only produce things that can only be seen by those who can see spirits to a certain extent.",""],["やむを得ず、ときに危険な場所を通過させざるを\n得ない場合もあるが、できることは惜しまぬつもりだ。","Sometimes we have no choice but to pass through dangerous places.\nThere may be times when I don't get anything, but I'll do my best.",""],["真っ暗闇になった際は、\n\\C[1]指先や矢印の触れる先が光る\\C[0]ようにできない\nものだろうか。","When it gets dark,\n\\C[1] I can't make the tips of my fingers or arrows light up \\C[0]\nIs it something?",""],["\\n<\\N[2]>青鬼がときおり、まっすぐ追いかけてこない\n素振りを見せたのは、\nこの文（ふみ）の主のおかげだったのでしょうか……。","\\n<\\N[2]> Blue demons sometimes don't follow me straight.\nThe person who showed off his movements was\nMaybe it was because of the author of this sentence...",""],["『解く力』は己に対する理解につながる。\\!\n悪意たちは表にこそ出さないが、\nむしろ『解く力』を待っているフシさえ感じることがある。","``The power to solve'' leads to understanding of oneself. \\!\nMalice does not show itself publicly, but\nIn fact, sometimes I even feel like I'm waiting for the ``power to solve''.",""],["悪意であれ、善意であれ、その力を意識的、無意識的に\n欲するところは変わらないのかもしれない。","Whether maliciously or benevolently, the power is consciously or unconsciously\nWhat you want may not change.",""],["客人たる彼女たちの悪意は、\nどのような『解く力』を待っているのだろうか。\n我が家のどこかに具現化しているのだろうか。","The malice of these women, who are guests, is\nWhat kind of “solving power” are you waiting for?\nI wonder if it is materializing somewhere in our house.",""],["死者は他者を操ることには長けている。\\!\nしかし、『解く力』に長けているのは、\nどういうわけか、生ある人間のようだ。","The dead are good at manipulating others. \\!\nHowever, those who are good at \"solving power\" are\nFor some reason, he seems like a living human being.",""],["いろいろ考えてみたが、\n生きているときの方が、発想を根幹から\n変える機会に恵まれているからでは、とも思う。","I thought about it a lot, but\nIt's better to think from the roots when you're alive.\nI think it's because I'm blessed with the opportunity to change.",""],["異論を聞きたい。\\!\n異論を聞こうにも、死者の世界は未練の化身のような者が多く、\n取り合ってもらえる者に出会えるのは稀なのだ……。","I would like to hear any objections. \\!\nDespite the objections, there are many people in the world of the dead who are like the embodiment of the unrefined.\nIt's rare to meet someone who can take care of you...",""],["------------------------------------\n◆画像準備","------------------------------------\n◆Image preparation",""],["------------------------------------","------------------------------------",""],["直近の手記が\n時系列に記されている。","The most recent notes\nwritten in chronological order.",""],["これまでの住まいを追われ、新居と決めた屋敷には\n別の悪意が住んでいた。","After being chased out of his previous home, the mansion he decided to make his new home...\nAnother malice lived.",""],["見ていると、私を殺した男（元夫）を思い出す。\nここから追い出して自分の居場所を手に入れなければ。","When I look at it, I remember the man (my ex-husband) who killed me.\nI have to get you out of here and get your own place.",""],["何度か始末しようとしたが手強い。\n何度も飲み込まれるうち、私も俊雄も相手の悪意の力や記憶を\n得たようだけど、それでも倒せない。","I tried to kill him several times, but he was too tough.\nAs we were swallowed up many times, both Toshio and I realized the power and memories of the other person's malice.\nIt seems like I got it, but I still can't beat it.",""],["こんな相手は初めてだ……","It's my first time meeting someone like this...",""],["私の居場所はガラクタのように壊され、\n今日、とうとう残骸すらない更地になってしまった。\\!\n\\C[7]あの男、覚えていろ……","My place was destroyed like junk,\nToday, it has finally become a vacant lot with no remains left. \\!\n\\C[7] Remember that man...",""],["今日、\\N[2]という男の子が屋敷に現れた。\n（屋敷の悪意の記憶から名前がわかった）\\!\n小林くんとどこか雰囲気の似ている子。","Today, a boy named \\N[2] appeared at the mansion.\n(I learned the name from the mansion's malicious memory) \\!\nA child who has a somewhat similar atmosphere to Kobayashi-kun.",""],["この子も大人になったら、\n小林くんが私の想いに気づかなかったように、\n気づけば気づいたでゴキブリのように拒絶するように、\\!\n誰かの想いを踏みにじる人間になるのだろうか。","When this child becomes an adult,\nJust like Kobayashi-kun didn't notice my feelings,\n\\! as if I noticed it and rejected it like a cockroach.\nWill he become the kind of person who tramples on someone else's feelings?",""],["きっとそうに違いない。許せない。","I'm sure it must be so. I can't forgive it.",""],["きっとそうに違いない。許せない。きっとそうに違いない。許せない。許せない。\nきっとそうに違いないきっとそうに違いない。許せない。許せない。許せない。きっとそうに違いない。\n\\C[8]許せない。許せない。許せない。許せない。許せない。許せない。許せない。\n\\C[7]許せない許せない許せない許せない許せない許せない許せない許せない許せない許せない\\|\\^","I'm sure it must be so. I can't forgive it. I'm sure it must be so. I can't forgive it. I can't forgive it.\nIt must be so, it must be so. I can't forgive it. I can't forgive it. I can't forgive it. I'm sure it must be so.\n\\C[8] I can't forgive it. I can't forgive it. I can't forgive it. I can't forgive it. I can't forgive it. I can't forgive it. I can't forgive it.\n\\C[7] I can't forgive I can't forgive I can't forgive I can't forgive I can't forgive I can't forgive I can't forgive I can't forgive \\|\\^",""],["そんなひどい人間の芽は摘んでしまわなければ。\\!\n写真でみた中学生のころの小林くんのような\nかわいさがあるところも許せない。 ","We need to nip this terrible person in the bud. \\!\nLike Kobayashi-kun when he was a junior high school student in the photo.\nI also can't stand the cuteness. ",""],["あとで小林くんと同じところにしまっておこう。","Let's store it in the same place as Kobayashi-kun later.",""],["\\n<\\N[2]>……………………。","\\n<\\N[2]>…………………….",""],["\\n<珠緒>見事なまでの言いがかりだね。","\\n<珠緒> That's a really nice excuse.",""],["\\n<経蔵>ふっ。\\.\\.珠緒、お前とは格が違うな？","\\n<経蔵> Huh. \\.\\. Tamao, aren't you on a different level?",""],["\\n<珠緒>……………………。","\\n<珠緒>…………………….",""],["\\n<経蔵>被害者意識をこじらせて、\nなんでも恨むようにしか考えられなくなっちまった。","\\n<経蔵> Aggravating the victim mentality,\nAll I could think about was hating everything.",""],["\\n<経蔵>自分や他人の理性や良心の訴えも受け付けない。\\!\nそれが、\\.\\.バケモンって生きモンなのさ……","\\n<経蔵>I do not accept appeals of reason or conscience from myself or others. \\!\nThat's \\.\\.Bemon is a living monster...",""],["\\n<\\N[2]>……………………。\\!\n私は人の気持ちに疎い人間です。","\\n<\\N[2]>……………………. \\!\nI'm a person who doesn't care about people's feelings.",""],["\\n<\\N[2]>友人が青鬼に殺されたにも関わらず、\n友を悼む気持ちとは別に、\nその青鬼に対して学術的な興味が湧く。","\\n<\\N[2]>Even though my friend was killed by the blue demon,\nApart from my feelings of mourning for my friend,\nI have developed an academic interest in the blue demon.",""],["\\n<\\N[2]>そんな人間です……。\\!\nですので、彼女の忠告ともとれるこの言葉、\n肝に銘じたいと思います。","\\n<\\N[2]> That's the kind of person I am... \\!\nTherefore, these words can also be interpreted as her advice.\nI would like to keep this in mind.",""],["\\n<経蔵>だとよ、伽椰子？  \\.\\.よかったな。\\!\nある意味良心的にお前の恨み節を受け止めてるぜ。\\!\nこいつを殺すのは待った方がいいかもな？","Is it \\n<経蔵>, Kayako?  \\.\\. Good. \\!\nIn a sense, I accept your grudge clause with a conscience. \\!\nMaybe I should wait to kill this guy?",""],["\\n<珠緒>（疎さが良心的な解釈になることもあるんだね……）","\\n<珠緒> (Sometimes looseness can be interpreted as a good thing...)",""],["-----------------------------------------\nひろしコメント済","-----------------------------------------\nHiroshi commented",""],["……小林くんの口から優しい言葉が聞きたかった。\\!\n聞きたかったのに……！\\!\nこの子ときたら……\\!","...I wanted to hear kind words from Kobayashi-kun's mouth. \\!\nI wanted to hear it...! \\!\nWhen it comes to this girl...\\!",""],["私の欲しかったものを、\\.\\.手に入れられなかったものを\n不躾にちらつかせて……！！\\!\nそんなキレイごと、\\.\\.あとで忘れるに決まってる……！！","What I wanted, what I couldn't get \\.\\.\nShow me your disrespect...! ! \\!\nSuch a beautiful thing, \\.\\. I'm sure I'll forget about it later...! !",""],["あああああああああ……\\!\nあ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛……！！","",""],["\\C[8]あ゛あ゛ぁ゛゛゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛゛あ゛あ゛ぁぁぁ゛゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛\n\\C[8]あ゛あ゛ぁぁぁ゛あ゛あ゛ぁぁぁぁ゛あ゛あ゛ぁぁぁ゛゛ぁ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛\n\\C[8]あ゛あ゛ぁ゛゛゛あ゛あ゛ぁ゛゛ぁ゛あ゛あ゛゛゛゛ぁぁ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛\n\\C[8]あ゛あ゛ぁぁぁぁ゛あ゛゛ぁぁぁぁ゛あ゛あ゛ぁぁぁ゛゛゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛","",""],["\\C[7]あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛ぁ゛あ゛ぁ゛ぁ゛あ゛ぁぁぁぁあ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛\n\\C[7]あ゛あ゛あ゛ぁぁぁ゛あ゛あ゛ぁぁぁぁ゛あ゛あ゛ぁぁぁぁぁぁあ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛\n\\C[7]あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛ぁ゛ぁ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛ぁ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛\n\\C[7]あ゛あ゛ぁぁぁぁぁぁぁ゛あ゛あ゛ぁ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛゛ぁ゛゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛","",""],["\\n<珠緒>恨み節のわりに\n気配でうろたえまくってるのがバレバレ。\nなにこのオバサン……","\\n<珠緒> Despite the grudge festival\nIt's obvious that he's flustered by his presence.\nWhat is this old lady...",""],["\\n<\\N[2]>内容が追記されている……！？","\\n<\\N[2]> content has been added...! ?",""],["\\n<経蔵>言わなかったか？\\.\\.\nこれは伽椰子の身体のようなもの。\\!\n生きモンなんだよ……","Didn't you say \\n<経蔵>? \\.\\.\nThis is like Kayako's body. \\!\nIt's a living thing...",""],["\\n<珠緒>あーやだね。\\.\\.\nいい年して乙女こじらせたくないね。","\\n<珠緒> Oh no. \\.\\.\nI don't want to make it difficult for a young girl to get old.",""],["\\n<経蔵>ふっ。\\.\\.別のモンこじらせてるやつがドヤるなよ。","\\n<経蔵> Huh. \\.\\. Don't be so proud of the guy who's making it difficult for another guy.",""],["\\n<経蔵>せっかく助けてやったのに、\nこんど伽椰子に襲われても助けてやんねえぞ？","\\n<経蔵>Even though I tried to help you,\nEven if Kayako attacks you next time, you won't help her, okay?",""],["\\n<経蔵>ふっ。伽椰子？\\.\\.\n\\N[2]を気に入ったんなら、\nあと十数年待ってひろしと再婚でもするか？","\\n<経蔵> Huh. Kayako? \\.\\.\nIf you like \\N[2],\nShould I wait another ten years and remarry Hiroshi?",""],["\\n<珠緒>で、離婚がわりに殺しとけば？　\\.\\.秒殺で。","\\n<珠緒>, what if I killed her instead of getting divorced? \\.\\. Killed in seconds.",""],["\\n<\\N[2]>（お二人はどこに話を持っていこうと\nしているのでしょうか……）","\\n<\\N[2]> (Where are you two going to talk?\nI wonder if they are doing that...)",""],["以前から私たちのことを嗅ぎ回っていた\n霊媒師の２人組が新居に乗り込んできた。","He's been sniffing around us for a while now.\nA pair of spiritual mediums entered the new house.",""],["まずは小学生のときに私をいじめていた●●●●に似ている珠緒。\\!\n目が見えず、多くの人の世話になっているだろうに、\n逆に周囲に悪態ばかりついている。\\.\\.私が一番嫌いな類の人間だ。","First of all, Tamao looks like the ●●●● who bullied me when I was in elementary school. \\!\nHe was blind and was being cared for by many people.\nOn the contrary, he only curses those around him. \\.\\. He's the kind of person I hate the most.",""],["しかし、風呂場に誘い込んで\n手にかけようとしたとろ、貞子に珠緒を横取りされた。","However, I invited her to the bathroom.\nWhen I tried to hold it in my hand, Sadako stole it from me.",""],["\\n<経蔵>伽椰子……\\.\\.珠緒も素直じゃねえんだよ。\n\\.\\.お前といっしょでな。","\\n<経蔵> Kayako...\\.\\. Tamao isn't honest either.\n\\.\\. With you.",""],["\\n<経蔵>ノートだとおしゃべりだな。伽椰子。\\.\\.\n俺らとこのノートでチャットでもするか？","\\n<経蔵> It's talkative when it's a notebook. Kayako. \\.\\.\nWould you like to chat with us on this notebook?",""],["貞子、青鬼と争って気が緩んだスキに、霊媒師の経蔵が……\\!\n何を思ったのか、私の治療を仕掛けてきた。","Sadako and Suki, who have become discouraged after fighting with Ao Oni, are met by the spiritual medium Kyozo...\\!\nI don't know what he was thinking, but he set up a treatment for me.",""],["確かに身体の具合が良くなった。\\!\n俊雄とマーも同様だった。","My physical condition has certainly improved. \\!\nThe same was true for Toshio and Ma.",""],["それだけじゃなかった。\\!\n私の中から小林くんの姿が薄れてしまった。\\!\nほんのりとしか想えなくなってしまった。","That wasn't all. \\!\nKobayashi-kun's image has faded from my mind. \\!\nI can only vaguely imagine it.",""],["にもかかわらず、落ち着いている自分がいる。\\!\nその理由で経蔵を恨む気も起きてこない。\\!\nあの男、何をたくらんでいる……？","Despite this, I find myself staying calm. \\!\nI don't feel like holding a grudge against Keizo for that reason. \\!\nWhat is that man plotting...?",""],["\\n<経蔵>ふっ、\\.\\.ケガの治療ついでに施した、\n「恋愛感情を解毒・解呪して炎症を抑える法術」が\n効いたみたいだな。","\\n<経蔵>Huh, \\.\\.I applied it while treating the injury.\n``A method to detoxify and cure romantic feelings and suppress inflammation''\nLooks like it worked.",""],["\\n<経蔵>初恋相手と距離をとるのも\n案外ラクになるもんだぜ？　\\.\\.伽椰子……。","\\n<経蔵> Keeping distance from your first love\nIt's surprisingly easy, isn't it? \\.\\. Kayako....",""],["\\n<珠緒>伽椰子、呪う動機を急に減らされて\n戸惑ってるみたい。\\!いけるかも。","\\n<珠緒> Kayako, her motivation to curse has suddenly decreased.\nYou seem confused. \\! might be possible.",""],["\\n<\\N[2]>治療が抑止力になるとは……。","\\n<\\N[2]> treatment will be a deterrent...",""],["\\n<経蔵>ふ。\\.\\.最大の攻撃になって何よりだ。","\\n<経蔵>fu. \\.\\. It's the biggest attack ever.",""],["----------------------------------------\nここはグラフィックを置く","----------------------------------------\nPlace the graphics here",""],["表面のリスト","list of surfaces",""],["裏面のメモ１","Memo 1 on the back",""],["裏面のメモ２","Memo 2 on the back",""],["メモをしまう","put away notes",""],["⑤：リストにない文字で、\n　　文字が数値と解釈できる場合は、その通りでよい。","⑤: Characters not in the list,\nIf the characters can be interpreted as numbers, that's fine.",""],["④：直感を優先すべし。","④: Give priority to intuition.",""],["③：位置の値。","③: Position value.",""],["②：感染した部分を望ましい文字に直し、\n　　修復した部分を変換した値を答えよ。","②: Correct the infected part to the desired character,\nAnswer the converted value of the repaired part.",""],["　　ただし、修復すべき文字がリストになかった場合は、\n　　修復前の文字を変換するものとする。","However, if the character to be repaired is not in the list,\nThe characters before repair shall be converted.",""],["①：リングウィルスが誕生した年を西暦で答えよ。","①：Answer the year in which the Ring Virus was born using the Western calendar.",""],["\\n<経蔵>貞子の呪い＝ウィルス説、てのがあったな。\\!\nとすると、ウィルスの生年は貞子が井戸に投げ込まれて\n死んだとされる年……。","\\n<経蔵> There was a theory that Sadako's curse was a virus. \\!\nThen, Virus' birth year is the year Sadako was thrown into the well.\nThe year he is said to have died...",""],["\\n<経蔵>それが、偶然にも\\C[1]伽椰子の生年\\C[0]でもあったな。\n何年だったか……。\\!\nったく、何の“呪縁”だよ……。","\\n<経蔵>That also happened to be \\C[1] Kayako's year of birth, \\C[0].\nWhat year was it? \\!\nJust what kind of “cursed relationship” is this?",""],["--------------------------------\nこの音が鳴るときはコンプリート扱い","--------------------------------\nWhen this sound is heard, it is considered complete.",""],["-----------------------------------\n化け物たちを追い払う","-----------------------------------\nchase away the monsters",""],["\\n<経蔵>ナメんじゃねえぞ！？","\\n<経蔵> Don't be lazy! ?",""],["-----------------------------------------------","-----------------------------------------------",""],["CastCommonEventName 青 金縛りアニメ","CastCommonEventName Blue Kinbaku Anime",""],["CastCommonEventName 青 方向混乱アニメ","CastCommonEventName Blue Directional confusion animation",""],["InputConfuse rev ","InputConfuse rev ",""],["InputConfuse def","InputConfuse def",""],["InputConfuse r90","InputConfuse r90",""],["InputConfuse l90","InputConfuse l90",""],["AooniKayakoHouseProcess hide 5","AooniKayakoHouseProcess hide 5",""],["-----------------------------------------\nクリックライト初期化","-----------------------------------------\nClick light initialization",""],["mg","mg",""],["AltBgs play sdky_noise1 0","AltBgs play sdky_noise1 0",""],["AltBgs fadeOut 0 2","AltBgs fadeOut 0 2",""],["SetInterlockSwitch 297","SetInterlockSwitch 297",""],["SetCommonOnRelease 117","SetCommonOnRelease 117",""],["-----------------------------------\n１F玄関専用","-----------------------------------\n1F entrance only",""],["SuspendEvent 青","SuspendEvent Blue",""],["出口Ｘ","Exit",""],["出口Ｙ","Exit Y",""],["\n↑ \\V[106] 歩","\n↑ \\V[106] step",""],[