:"HU"}],[null,{}]],"cacheResetOnChange":{},"lastSelectedCell":[108,0]},"data/Map001.json":{"data":[["青","blue","blue"],["-----------------------\nコミカル転倒イベント用","-----------------------\nFor comical fall events","-----------------------\nFor comical fall events"],["\\n<\\N[2]>何に転んだのでしょう？\\!\nショックで倒立から戻れないようですが……","\\n<\\N[2]> What happened? \\!\nIt seems like he can't come back from the headstand due to shock...","\\n<\\N[2]>What's got you all turned around?\\!\nIt seems like he's frozen from shock..."],["EV002","EV002","EV002"],["EV003","EV003","EV003"],["青チラ","Blue sneak peek","Blue sneak peek"],["EV005","EV005","EV005"],["EV006","EV006","EV006"],["\\n<\\N[2]>寝室の鍵を手に入れた","\\n<\\N[2]> Got the key to the bedroom.","\\n<\\N[2]>I found the item, \"Bedroom Key\"."],["=======================================\nイベントページ３\n（コミカル＋アイテム出現中のページの左）\nに配置します。","=======================================\nEvent page 3\n(Left of the page where Comical+Item appears)\nPlace it in","=======================================\nEvent page 3\n(Left of the page where Comical+Item appears)\nPlace it in"],["\n-------------------------------------------\nコミカルモード新演出。\nこのアクションで、コミカル編に登場する本編の\n青鬼たちには会話が可能ということを示唆します。","\n-------------------------------------------\nNew comical mode production.\nIn this action, the main story that appears in the comical version\nThis suggests that the blue demons are capable of conversation.","\n-------------------------------------------\nNew comical mode production.\nIn this action, the main story that appears in the comical version\nThis suggests that the blue demons are capable of conversation."],["\\n<\\N[2]>ここにも化け物！？","\\n<\\N[2]> There's a monster here too! ?","\\n<\\N[2]>There's a monster here too!?"],["\\n<\\N[2]>……こちらを殺そうとする\n化け物ばかりではないようですね。\\!\n接触を試みてもいいかもしれません。","\\n<\\N[2]>...trying to kill me\nIt seems like it's not just monsters. \\!\nYou might try to make contact.","\\n<\\N[2]>...It seems like not all the monsters\nhere are trying to killing us.\\!\nIt might be worth trying to communicate."],["---------------------------------\n鍵は自動入手\n（従来の手動入手用ページは出現させただけ）","---------------------------------\nGet the key automatically\n(The conventional manual acquisition page has only appeared)","---------------------------------\nGet the key automatically\n(The conventional manual acquisition page has only appeared)"],["\\n<\\N[2]>屋根裏部屋の鍵を手に入れた","\\n<\\N[2]> Obtained the key to the attic.","\\n<\\N[2]>I found the item, \"Attic Key\"."],["屋根裏部屋の鍵を手に入れた","got the key to the attic","got the key to the attic"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>そうそう。コレ持っていかないとね。","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]/Unit 4> That's right. I need to bring this with me.","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]/Unit 4>Right, right. I need to take this with me."],["青位置設定","blue position setting","blue position setting"],["--------------------\n■デバッグモード","--------------------\n■Debug mode","--------------------\n■Debug mode"],["--------------------","--------------------","--------------------"],["青ルート補正","blue route correction","blue route correction"],["ランダム青出現設定","Random blue appearance setting","Random blue appearance setting"],["フワッティーＣ","Fuwatty C","Fuwatty C"],["飛び鬼Ｃ","Flying demon C","Flying demon C"],["\\n<\\N[2]>飛び乗って逃げることは\nできないようですね……！","\\n<\\N[2]> Jumping and running away\nIt seems like you can't do it...!","\\n<\\N[2]>It doesn't look like I can just\njump on and fly away...!"],["--------------------------------------\n飛び鬼ワープアクション","--------------------------------------\nflying demon warp action","--------------------------------------\nflying demon warp action"],["\\n<\\N[2]>プロペラのないドローン……？\\!\nどんな仕組みなのでしょうか……","\\n<\\N[2]> A drone without propellers...? \\!\nHow does it work...","\\n<\\N[2]>A propeller-less drone...? \\!\nI wonder how that works..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>その『ドローン』でしたか！！","\\n<\\N[2]> Was that a \"drone\"? !","\\n<\\N[2]>It was that, \"drone\", after all!"],["トカゲ鬼小Ｃ","Lizard demon small C","Lizard demon small C"],["\\n<\\N[2]>単眼爬虫類型ロボットでしょうか。\\!\nこの「カサカサ」という動きは苦手な方も\nおられるかもしれませんね。","\\n<\\N[2]> Is it a monocular reptile type robot? \\!\nSome people don't like this \"rustling\" movement.\nYou may be there.","\\n<\\N[2]>A one-eyed reptilian robot thing?\\!\nSome people might find that scuttling\na bit off-putting."],["\\n<\\N[2]>おっと、転ぶところでした！","\\n<\\N[2]> Whoops, I almost fell!","\\n<\\N[2]>Woah, I almost fell!"],["Ｃ青転倒イベント","C blue fall event","C blue fall event"],["--------------------------------------\nこのモードで不使用の\nハッカドール用変数を拝借","--------------------------------------\nUnused in this mode\nBorrowing variables for Hacka Doll","--------------------------------------\nUnused in this mode\nBorrowing variables for Hacka Doll"],[null,null,null,null,null]],"context":[["Map001/events/1/name"],["Map001/events/1/pages/6/list/0/comment"],["Map001/events/1/pages/6/list/2/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map001/events/2/name"],["Map001/events/3/name"],["Map001/events/4/name"],["Map001/events/5/name"],["Map001/events/6/name"],["Map001/events/6/pages/1/list/5/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map001/events/6/pages/2/list/0/comment"],["Map001/events/6/pages/2/list/6/comment"],["Map001/events/6/pages/2/list/31/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map001/events/6/pages/2/list/60/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map001/events/6/pages/2/list/121/comment"],["Map001/events/6/pages/2/list/130/message/hasPicture/bottom","Map001/events/6/pages/3/list/3/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map001/events/6/pages/4/list/3/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map001/events/6/pages/4/list/5/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map001/events/7/name"],["Map001/events/7/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map001/events/7/pages/0/list/7/comment"],["Map001/events/8/name"],["Map001/events/9/name"],["Map001/events/10/name"],["Map001/events/11/name"],["Map001/events/11/pages/0/list/12/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map001/events/11/pages/0/list/15/comment"],["Map001/events/11/pages/0/list/102/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map001/events/11/pages/0/list/119/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map001/events/12/name"],["M