V012","EV012"],["EV013","EV013","EV013"],["EV014","EV014","EV014"],["玄関","Entrance","Entrance"],["-------------------------------------\n青鬼強制消去\n録画終了","-------------------------------------\nBlue demon forced deletion\nRecording finished","-------------------------------------\nBlue demon forced deletion\nRecording finished"],["\\n<\\N[2]>緑の鍵を使った","\\n<\\N[2]> Used green key","\\n<\\N[2]>Used the Green Key."],["\\n<\\N[2]>玄関の鍵を使った","\\n<\\N[2]> Used the front door key","\\n<\\N[2]>Used the Front Door Key."],["\\n<\\N[2]>鍵が掛かっている","\\n<\\N[2]> Locked","\\n<\\N[2]>The door is locked."],["玄関の鍵を使った","used the door key","used the door key"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>敷地の外まで逃げればよかったはず！！","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> It would have been better to run outside the premises! !","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>I shoulda just ran outta here!!"],["鍵が掛かっている","It's locked","It's locked"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>ここに来る前に確かめたデータだと……\n玄関の鍵は上の方の階にあったような……","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>The data I checked before coming here...\nThe key to the entrance seemed to be on the upper floor...","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>According to the data I gathered before coming here...\nThe entrance key should be on one of the the upper floors..."],["たけし","Takeshi","Takeshi"],["美香","Mika","Mika"],["卓郎","Takuro","Takuro"],["---------------------\n■プレイヤーの設定","---------------------\n■Player settings","---------------------\n■Player settings"],["---------------------","---------------------","---------------------"],["\\n<卓郎>中は思ったよりきれいだな","\\n<卓郎> It's more beautiful than I expected.","\\n<Takuro>It's a lot prettier on the inside."],["\\n<美香>なんだか寒いわ……","\\n<美香> It's kind of cold...","\\n<Mika>... Is it just me, or is it cold in here...?"],["\\n<たけし>お、おい……\nもう帰ろうぜ……","\\n<たけし>Oh, hey...\nLet's go home now...","\\n<Takeshi>H- Hey...\nLet's get out of here..."],["\\n<卓郎>何だよたけし\nビビってんのか？","\\n<卓郎> What is it, Takeshi?\nAre you scared?","\\n<Takuro>What's wrong, Takeshi?\nYou scared?"],["\\n<たけし>！！","\\n<たけし>! !","\\n<Takeshi>!!"],["\\n<たけし>お、おい……\\!\nもう帰ろうぜ……","\\n<たけし> Oh, hey... \\!\nLet's go home now...","\\n<Takeshi>H- Hey...\nLet's get out of here..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>馬鹿馬鹿しい……\\!\nお化けなどいる訳がないでしょう\n科学的に考えて……","\\n<\\N[2]> That's ridiculous...\\!\nThere's no such thing as a ghost.\nThink scientifically...","\\n<\\N[2]>So stupid...\\!\nThere is no way monsters can exist.\nIt's scientifically impossible..."],["\\n<たけし>お、おい！\n\\N[2]！\\!\n気をつけろよ！！","\\n<たけし> Oh, hey!\n\\N[2]!\\!\nBe careful! !","\\n<Takeshi>H- Hey! \\N[2]!\\!\nBe careful!!"],["\\n<\\N[2]>！","\\n<\\N[2]>!","\\n<\\N[2]>!"],["\\n<\\N[2]>皆さん……？","\\n<\\N[2]> Everyone...?","\\n<\\N[2]>Guys...?"],["青鬼Ｃ・Ｈ","Blue Oni C.H.","Blue Oni C.H."],["\n画像に青鬼キルシーンの空白部を指定して\n事前読込みをしています。","\nSpecify the blank part of the blue demon kill scene in the image\nPreloading is in progress.","\nSpecify the blank part of the blue demon kill scene in the image\nPreloading is in progress."],["たけしＣ・３号・ハゲ２号","Takeshi C・No.3・Bald No.2","Takeshi C・No.3・Bald No.2"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号>『生きてるだけで丸坊主』……\\.\\.\n『生きてるだけで丸坊主』……\\.\\.\n『生きてるだけで丸坊主』……\\.\\.","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号> “Just being alive is a shaved head”...\\.\\.\n“Just being alive is a shaved head”…\\.\\.\n“Just being alive is a shaved head”…\\.\\.","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]Unit 2>\"Being bald makes me feel alive.\"...\\.\\.\n\"Being bald makes me feel alive.\"...\\.\\.\n\"Being bald makes me feel alive.\"...\\.\\."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号>うふふ、\\.\\.お出かけかしら？　\\.\\.４号ちゃん","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号> Hehe, \\.\\. Are you going out? \\.\\. No.4-chan","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]Unit 2>Hehe,\\.\\. Are you headed out?\\.\\. Unit 4?"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号>ラララのラ～～♪","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号> La la la la~♪","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]Unit 2>La la la do la~♪"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>ショックが強すぎて掃除おばさんに！？","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> I was so shocked that I became a cleaning lady! ?","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>I was so shocked that I turned into a cleaning lady."],["美香Ｃ・２号","Mika C.2","Mika C.2"],["美香Ｃ頭・２号髪","Mika C head/No. 2 hair","Mika C head/No. 2 hair"],["-----------------------------------\nイベント用ロボ画像の読込も兼ねます。\n画像部分は\n!robomembers_cm_neck_libの、\n空白部を指定してます。","-----------------------------------\nIt also serves as loading of robot images for events.\nThe image part\n!robomembers_cm_neck_lib,\nSpecifies the blank space.","-----------------------------------\nIt also serves as loading of robot images for events.\nThe image part\n!robomembers_cm_neck_lib,\nSpecifies the blank space."],["----------------------------------\n髪の毛、空白部指定して準備","----------------------------------\nSpecify hair and blank areas and prepare","----------------------------------\nSpecify hair and blank areas and prepare"],["ラスト通せんぼ鬼","The last demon","The last demon"],["ネズミ右上","Mouse top right","Mouse top right"],["新規演出。\n今回は遺体がロボなので、\n物色して「食えない」とみると去っていった……\nという演出です。","New production.\nThis time the corpse is a robot, so\nHe looked around and when he saw that he couldn't eat it, he left...\nThis is a performance.","New production.\nThis time the corpse is a robot, so\nHe looked around and when he saw that he couldn't eat it, he left...\nThis is a performance."],["ネズミ左下","Mouse bottom left","Mouse bottom left"],["ネズミ左上","Mouse top left","Mouse top left"],["----------------------------\nこのネズミに\n美香死体画像の読込みを\nしてもらってます。","----------------------------\nto this rat\nLoad Mika corpse image\nI have it done.","----------------------------\nto this rat\nLoad Mika corpse image\nI have it done."],["----------------------------------\n青鬼差分画像を読み込んで\nもらってます。","----------------------------------\nLoad the Aooni difference image\nI'm getting it.","----------------------------------\nLoad the Aooni difference image\nI'm getting it."],["ネズミ右下","Mouse bottom right","Mouse bottom right"],["卓郎Ｃ・１号","Takuro C.1","Takuro C.1"],["---------------------\n■プレイヤー（コミカル）の設定","---------------------\n■Player (comical) settings","---------------------\n■Player (comical) settings"],["\n-------------------------------\nふうきゅう追記ぶん\n首ジャンプ追加","\n-------------------------------\nFuukyu additional notes\nAdded neck jump","\n-------------------------------\nFuukyu additional notes\nAdded neck jump"],["---------------------\nおろおろする美香と\nヤケするたけしのアクション","---------------------\nWith a fearful Mika\nTakeshi's action to burn","---------------------\nWith a fearful Mika\nTakeshi's action to burn"],["\\n<たけし>クソッ！　付き合ってられるか！\n俺はもう帰るぜ！","\\n<たけし> Shit! Can we go out together!\nI'm going home now!","\\n<Takeshi>Fuck yeah! I can be done with this!\nI'm going home!"],["\\n<たけし>！","\\n<たけし>!","\\n<Takeshi>!"],["\\n<たけし>ドアが開かない！","\\n<たけし> The door won't open!","\\n<Takeshi>The door won't open!"],["\\n<卓郎>なんだって！","It's \\n<卓郎>!","\\n<卓郎>What!?"],["---------------------\n■青鬼現れる\n（美香のアクション随所に追記）","---------------------\n■Aoki appears\n(Added to Mika's actions)","---------------------\n■Aoki appears\n(Added to Mika's actions)"],["---------------------\nウェイトのかわりに、\n美香の後ずさりを配置","---------------------\nInstead of weights,\nPlace Mika's back","---------------------\nInstead of weights,\nPlace Mika's back"],["\\n<美香>キャー","\\n<美香>","\\n<Mika>Kyaaaa-!"],["---------------------\n■頭飛ばす準備","---------------------\n■Preparing to blow your head off","---------------------\n■Preparing to blow your head off"],["---------------------\n■美香頭トスして驚く","---------------------\n■ Mika is surprised by the head toss.","---------------------\n■ Mika is surprised by the head toss."],["---------------------\n■青鬼アニメーション\n　美香に攻撃","---------------------\n■Blue demon animation\nAttack on Mika","---------------------\n■Blue demon animation\nAttack on Mika"],["---------------------\n■美香頭壁にぶつかる","---------------------\n■ Mika Head Hits the wall","---------------------\n■ Mika Head Hits the wall"],["---------------------\n■落ちる頭と、\n　流れる血改め、ふわる髪\n　（頭と身体を順にアニメさせるため、フレーム１枚追加）","---------------------\n■Falling head and\nFlowing blood changes, fluffy hair\n(Added one frame to animate the head and body in sequence)","---------------------\n■Falling head and\nFlowing blood changes, fluffy hair\n(Added one frame to animate the head and body in sequence)"],["---------------------\n■美香崩れる\n　（こちらもフレーム１枚追加）","---------------------\n■Mika collapses\n(Also added one frame)","---------------------\n■Mika collapses\n(Also added one frame)"],["\\n<\\N[2]>何てこった！\n美香が（ショックで）殺されちゃった！","\\n<\\N[2]> Oh my god!\nMika was (shocked) killed!","\\n<\\N[2]>Oh my god!\nThey killed Mika!"],["\\n<卓郎>この人でなし！","\\n<卓郎> Not this person!","\\n<Takuro>You bastards!"],["---------------------\n■全員逃げる","---------------------\n■Everyone runs away","---------------------\n■Everyone runs away"],["----------------------------------\n■プレイヤー（ハッカドール）の設定","----------------------------------\n■Player (Hacka Doll) settings","----------------------------------\n■Player (Hacka Doll) settings"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>って、\\.\\.かの有名ホラーゲーム、\n『青鬼』の世界に来てみたのはいいんですけどっ……","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号> is a famous horror game called \\.\\..\nIt's nice to come to the world of \"Ao Oni\"...","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]Unit 1>I mean,\\.\\. I guess it's fine that I'm now in the world\nthat famous horror game, \"Ao Oni\", but..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>やっぱ怖いです〜っ……\\!\nいつもの決めポーズしてもやっぱり怖いです〜っ！","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号> It's really scary...\\!\nEven with the usual pose, it's still scary!","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]Unit 1>It's still quite scary~...\\!\nEven when I strike my signature pose, it's still so scary~!"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号>マスターさんをガイドする前に、\nまず私たちで感覚をつかみに来た、\\.\\.とはいえね……","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号>Before guiding the master,\nFirst of all, we came here to get a feel for it, even though it's \\.\\....","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]Unit 2>We came here to get a feel for things first,\nbefore we guide the master,\\.\\. but still..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号>なんか寒い……","\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号> It's kind of cold...","\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]Unit 3>... Is it me, or is it kinda cold...?"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>もしゼロ姉（０号）がついて来てくれたら、\nお化けの青鬼相手でも投げ飛ばしてくれそうなのに〜っ！","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>If Zero-nee (0) comes with me,\nIt looks like it could even throw away a ghostly blue demon opponent!","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]Unit 1>If only my big sis, Unit 0, had come along...\nShe could throw any ghostly blue monster across the room!"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号>きっと『子供じゃあるまいし！』\nって言われるのがオチね……","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号> I'm sure you're not a child! ”\nThat's the punch line...","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]Unit 2>I'll just end up getting told,\n\"You're not a child!\"..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>ゼロ姉はこっちを指揮する立場だし、\nおいそれとは来ないんじゃないかな〜？","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> Zero-nee is in a position to command us,\nI guess it won't come soon?","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>Big sis Unit Zero is our commander, so I don't think she'd just\ncome and drop in, you know~?"],["-------------------------------\n皿が割れる。４号はデータを\n把握してから来てるので、\n少々のことでは動じない\n-------------------------------","-------------------------------\nThe plate breaks. No. 4 is data\nI came here after understanding the\nI don't get moved by the slightest thing\n-------------------------------","-------------------------------\nThe plate breaks. No. 4 is data\nI came here after understanding the\nI don't get moved by the slightest thing\n-------------------------------"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>きしし、\\.\\.怖いの？　\\.\\.みんな♪","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> Squeak, \\.\\. Are you scared? \\.\\. Everyone♪","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>Keheheh,\\.\\. Are you scared?\\.\\. Everyone♪"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号>もうめんどくさいから帰るね～","\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号> It's too much trouble, so I'm going home~","\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]Unit 3>Fuck this. I'm going home!~"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号>あれ？　\\.\\.開かない……","\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号> Huh? \\.\\. Can't open...","\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]Unit 3>Huh?\\.\\. It won't open..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号>ジェイルハウスですものね……","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号> It's a jail house...","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]Unit 2>We're trapped..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>館の探索が終わるまで帰るな、\\.\\.ってやつですね……","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号> Don't go home until you finish exploring the mansion, \\.\\....","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]Unit 1>I guess it's one of those things where you can't leave until\nyou've explored everything\\.\\...."],["---------------------\n■青鬼現れる","---------------------\n■Aoki appears","---------------------\n■Aoki appears"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号>えっ、\\.\\.ゼロ姉……","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号> Huh, \\.\\. Zero-nee...","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]Unit 2>Wait.\\.\\. Big sis Zero..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号>じゃない！？","Not \\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号>! ?","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]Unit 2>It isn't!?"],["----------------------------------------\n青鬼攻撃。２号ハゲにされる","----------------------------------------\nBlue demon attack. Become a size 2 bald person","----------------------------------------\nBlue demon attack. Become a size 2 bald person"],["------------------------------------\n髪飛びイベント準備\n表示しないネズミをネズミのターゲットに指定","------------------------------------\nPreparing for hair flying event\nSpecify hidden rats as targets of rats","------------------------------------\nPreparing for hair flying event\nSpecify hidden rats as targets of rats"],["--------------------------------------------------------------","--------------------------------------------------------------","--------------------------------------------------------------"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号>いやーっ！\n髪のデータがーーーーっ！！","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号> Oh no!\nHair data! !","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]Unit 2>Oh no!\nMy hair data!!"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>に、\\.\\.２号ちゃんの髪がはぎとられたっ！？","\\.\\.2's hair was ripped off by \\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>! ?","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]Unit 1>Unit 2's hair was ripped off, then."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号>これが本当のハッギトール……","\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号> This is the real Haggitor...","\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]Unit 3>This is the true Hacka Doll..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>青鬼、なんで顔だけ元に戻っているんだろう？　\n顔もゼロ姉に似せたはずなんだけど……","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> Ao Oni, why has only his face returned to normal?　\nI was supposed to make her face look like Zero-nee...","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>Why has the blue monster's face returned to normal?　\nIt should have been made to look like big sis Zero too..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>っと。\\.\\.青鬼こっち来たよ。\\!\n↑の図書室にある本棚の裏を安全地帯に設定したのが、\nさっそく役に立つかな。","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>. \\.\\. Blue demon is here. \\!\nThe back of the bookshelf in the library above was set as a safe zone.\nI wonder if it will be useful right away.","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>Oh.\\.\\. The blue monster is coming this way.\\!\nI wonder if the safe place up behind the bookshelf in the library\nwill already be coming in handy."],["青鬼Ｃ階段","Aooni C stairs","Aooni C stairs"],["青位置設定","blue position setting","blue position setting"],["--------------------\n■Ｃコミカルモード","--------------------\n■C Comical mode","--------------------\n■C Comical mode"],["\\n<\\I[63] \\C[5]青鬼>\\C[5]想像しろ！\\.\\.\nお前の脳は、\\.\\.食う気がなくても食ってやる！！","\\n<\\I[63] \\C[5]青鬼>\\C[5]Imagine! \\.\\.\nI'll eat your brain even if you don't feel like it \\.\\.! !","\\n<\\I[63] \\C[5]Ao Oni>\\C[5]Imagine it!\\.\\.\nI'm going to eat your brain whether you want me to or not\\.\\.!!"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>アタシなんか食べても美味しくないって〜の！！！","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> Even if I eat something, it won't taste good! ! !","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>I don't taste good!!!"],["\\n<\\C[5]化け物>\\C[5]想像してみろ！\nお前の脳も僕に食われるんだ！","\\n<\\C[5]化け物>\\C[5]Imagine!\nI'll eat your brain too!","\\n<\\C[5]Monster>\\C[5]Imagine it!\nI'm going to eat your brain!"],["--------------------\n■デバッグモード","--------------------\n■Debug mode","--------------------\n■Debug mode"],["--------------------","--------------------","--------------------"],["ランダム青出現設定","Random blue appearance setting","Random blue appearance setting"],[null,null,null,null,null]],"context":[["Map004/events/1/name"],["Map004/events/2/name"],["Map004/events