cacheResetOnChange":{},"lastSelectedCell":[109,4]},"data/Map005.json":{"data":[["隠しドア","","hidden door"],["\\n<\\N[2]>壁紙に違和感を感じますね……","","\\n<\\N[2]>Something seems off about this wallpaper..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>ドアノブがないので開けられませんね……","","\\n<\\N[2]>There's no knob, so I can't open the door..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>壁紙に違和感を感じますね……","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>Something seems off about this wallpaper..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>なんちゃって♪\\!\nこの奥を、隠れ屋風カフェに改装したい感じ。","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>Just kidding~♪\\!\nI think I'd like to remodel this back room into a speakeasy."],["青","","blue"],["EV003","","EV003"],["EV004","","EV004"],["EV005","","EV005"],["EV006","","EV006"],["押入れ左","","closet left"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24] ４号>こっちはネコ型ロボットがいて欲しい方。","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>This person wants a cat-type robot."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24] ４号>そういえば『青猫』（○ラ○もん）も、\nまあるい頭の２等身だったねえ？\n『青鬼』と、おもしろい対比かも。","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>Come think about it, “Blue Cat”, (Doraemon) also had a round head\nwith his body only twice as tall, didn't he?\nMight make for an interesting comparison with this, \"Ao Oni\"."],["EV008","","EV008"],["\\n<\\N[2]>ライターを手に入れた","","\\n<\\N[2]>I found the item, \"Lighter\"."],["押入れ右","","closet right"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>こっちは本編で活躍するお化けの控え室。","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>This is the waiting room for the the main story's ghosts."],["===============================================\n（コミカル＋青出現中に有効）\n　","","===============================================\n(Effective while Comical + Blue appears)"],["コミカルひろしがスイッチがわり","","Comical Hiroshi turns the switch"],["\\n<\\N[2]>先客……\\.\\.ですか！？","","\\n<\\N[2]>Was...\\.\\. Someone already here!?"],["EV010","","EV010"],["===============================================\n\n（コミカル＋青出現中に有効）","","===============================================\n\n(Effective while Comical + Blue appears)"],["押し入れ右・青開ける","","Closet right/open blue"],["EV012","","EV012"],["青位置設定","","blue position setting"],["--------------------\n■デバッグモード","","--------------------\n■Debug mode"],["--------------------","","--------------------"],["EV014","","EV014"],["EV015","","EV015"],["EV016","","EV016"],["ルンバ鬼Ｃ","","Roomba Oni C"],["\\n<\\N[2]>お掃除中すみません、\n助けて下さい！","","\\n<\\N[2]>Sorry for interrupting your cleaning,\nbut please help me!"],["\\n<\\N[2]>……新型の掃除ロボットでしょうか？","","\\n<\\N[2]>...Is that a new type of cleaning robot?"],["\\n<\\N[2]>そんな機能をお持ちだったのですか。\\.\\.助かりました！！","","\\n<\\N[2]>I didn't know you had that feature.\\.\\. Thank you for your help!!"],["たけし鬼Ｃ","","Takeshi Oni C"],["\\n<\\N[2]>この屋敷にお住まいの方ですか？","","\\n<\\N[2]>Do you live in this mansion?"],["和室木下","","Japanese-style room Kinoshita"],["\\n<木ノ下>……んむ……","","\\n<Kinoshita>...Hmm..."],["\\n<木ノ下>ハッカ……\\.\\.ドール……？\\!\nなんでもはかどらせてくれるって……？\\.\\.\n公序良俗に反しない限り……","","\\n<Kinoshita>Hakka...\\.\\. Doll...?\\!\nIt helps you get *anything* done...?\\.\\.\nAs long as it doesn't do anything bad..."],["\\n<木ノ下>そりゃそうだ……","","\\n<Kinoshita>That makes sense..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>アタシの調べたデータだと確か、木ノ下さんか。\nこんなとこで寝てるなんて……","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>According to the data I've acquired, it's Mr. Kinoshita.\nTo think he'd be sleeping in a place like this..."],["\\n<木ノ下>得意分野は、サブカルチャーなのか……","","\\n<Kinoshita>So, is subculture your area of expertise?"],["\\n<木ノ下>かわいいＡＩだよなあ……","","\\n<Kinoshita>What a cute AI..."],["\\n<木ノ下>モバゲーに面白いゲームないかなあ……\\!\nハッカドールが教えてくれないかなあ……","","\\n<Kinoshita>I wonder if there are any good games on Mobage...\\!\nI wish the Hackadoll would tell me..."],["\\n<木ノ下>英語の得意な子だと助かるなあ……","","\\n<Kinoshita>It would sure help if the kid was good at English..."],["\\n<木ノ下>いっしょにカラオケ……\\.\\.\n行ってくれるかなあ……","","\\n<Kinoshita>Karaoke together...\\.\\.\nI wonder if they'd go to that with me..."],["\\n<木ノ下>家族に紹介とかしてるやつ、\nいるかなあ……","","\\n<Kinoshita>I wonder if there is anyone,\na kind of person who'd like to introduce them to their family..."],["\\n<木ノ下>“俺の守り神”って、\n喜んでるやつがいるって……\\.\\.本当かなあ……","","\\n<Kinoshita>“My guardian deity”... Tch.\nTo think someone's actually happy about that...\\.\\. Is it true...?"],["\\n<木ノ下>変わった名前なのは、\n実は○ッド○ボン製だから、\nとかじゃないよなあ……","","\\n<Kinoshita>It doesn't have a name like that\nbecause it was made by the Red Ribbon Army. (Dragon Ball)\nOr does it...?"],["\\n<木ノ下>え。\\.\\.４号なんてのもいるのか……","","\\n<Kinoshita>Huh.\\.\\. So there's a Unit 4, too...?"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>知らざァ行って捗らせやしょうか、\\.\\.\n木ノ下さん？？","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>Shall we go right ahead and operate blind,\\.\\.\nMr. Kinoshita??"],["＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝\nハッカドール編アナザーエンド\n\n＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝","","======================\nHacka Doll Another End\n\n======================"],["\\n<木ノ下>やっぱ青鬼怖ぇよなあ……","","\\n<Kinoshita>Man, Ao Oni really is scary..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>木ノ下さんも青鬼っていう噂ほんと！？\nもしアタシの調べ通りなら、\nこっちの青鬼を止めて！？","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>The rumor that Mr. Kinoshita is actually an Ao Oni is true!?\nIf my findings are correct,\nthis Ao Oni must be stopped!?"],["\\n<木ノ下>んむ……","","\\n<Kinoshita>Hmm..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>噂通り巨大化！？\\.\\.\n助けてくれるの！？\\!\nそれとも、\\.\\.寝た鬼（こ）を……！？","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>It's grown to massive size, just like the rumors said!\\.\\.\nIs it going to help us??\\!\nOr,\\.\\. are we waking a sleeping giant...!?"],["--------------------------------\n木ノ下青鬼現る\n\n--------------------------------","","--------------------------------\nKinoshita Ao Oni appears\n\n--------------------------------"],["--------------------------------\n４号に向かおうとする青鬼を\n木ノ下が寝ぼけつつ食い止める（？）\n--------------------------------","","--------------------------------\nAo Oni is about to head towards No. 4.\nKinoshita half-asleep stops him (?)\n--------------------------------"],["--------------------------------\n４号逃走。\n青鬼たちの攻防？は続く\n\n--------------------------------","","--------------------------------\nNo. 4 escaped.\nThe battle between the blue demons? continues\n\n--------------------------------"],["木下パディング用","","For Kinoshita padding"],["青