oshita variables borrowed for C Aooni\n---------------------------------------"],["割れた皿","","broken plate"],["\\n<\\N[2]>皿が割れていますね……","","\\n<\\N[2]>A plate is shattered on the ground..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>皿の破片を手に入れた","","\\n<\\N[2]>I found the item, \"Plate Shard\"."],["皿がないのは、\n「青鬼たちが片付けたのかも？」という設定。\n無敵時ハマリ防止を兼ねます","","There is no plate,\nThe setting is ``Maybe the blue demons cleaned it up?''\nAlso serves to prevent getting stuck when invincible"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>本編だと「ワレモノ注目」で大活躍な一品。\\.\\.\n今回はいらないけど……","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>In the main story, this item really shines when you're looking\nfor, \"cuttable\", things.\\.\\. I don't need it this time, though..."],["jmu","","jmu"],["\\n<木ノ下>……んむ……","","\\n<Kinoshita>...Hmm..."],["\\n<木ノ下>英訳疲れたー……帰ろうよママ……","","\\n<Kinoshita>I'm tired of translating to English... I want to go home, Mom..."],["\\n<木ノ下>モバゲーで何か面白いゲームないかな……","","\\n<Kinoshita>I wonder if there are any good games on Mobage..."],["\\n<木ノ下>歌手になりたい……なれるかな……","","\\n<Kinoshita>I want to be a singer... I wonder if I could make it as one..."],["\\n<木ノ下>大阪引っ越したいなぁ……","","\\n<Kinoshita>I really want to move to Osaka..."],["\\n<木ノ下>日本語難しいなぁ……","","\\n<Kinoshita>Japanese is hard..."],["\\n<木ノ下>青鬼怖ぇえなぁ……","","\\n<Kinoshita>Ao Oni is scaaary..."],["EV007","","EV007"],["EV008","","EV008"],["青ルート補正","","blue route correction"],["青位置設定","","blue position setting"],["--------------------\n■デバッグモード","","--------------------\n■Debug mode"],["--------------------","","--------------------"],["--------------------------------\n=300\nハッカドール隠しイベント用\n--------------------------------","","--------------------------------\n=300\nFor Hacka Doll Hidden Event\n--------------------------------"],["ランダム青出現設定","","Random blue appearance setting"],["ゆがみ鬼Ｃ","","Distortion demon C"],["\\n<\\N[2]>おとろけのところすみません、\n助けて下さい！","","\\n<\\N[2]>Sorry for interrupting you,\nbut please help me!"],["\\n<\\N[2]>……床暖房、\\.\\.\nとろけるほど気持ちいいですか？","","\\n<\\N[2]>...Heated floors.\\.\\.\nDon't they feel so good that it feels like you're melting?"],["-------------------------------\n以下、４鬼共通展開\n-------------------------------","","-------------------------------\nThe following is a common development for the 4 demons.\n-------------------------------"],["---------------------------\nロボ青鬼、追い払われる\n話しかけた青鬼がトドメをさす\n---------------------------","","---------------------------\nRobo Ao Oni is chased away\nThe blue demon you spoke to deals the final blow.\n---------------------------"],["---------------------------\nロボひろし、\n青鬼たちに一礼して逃げる\n---------------------------","","---------------------------\nHiroshi Robo,\nBow to the blue demons and run away\n---------------------------"],["\\n<\\N[2]>皆さん、ありがとうございます！！","","\\n<\\N[2]>Thank you so much, everyone!!"],["---------------------------\n話しかけた青鬼があいさつする\n---------------------------","","---------------------------\nThe blue demon you spoke to greets you.\n---------------------------"],["------------------------------","","------------------------------"],["巨人鬼Ｃ","","giant demon C"],["\\n<\\N[2]>お片付けのところすみません、\n助けて下さい！","","\\n<\\N[2]>Sorry for interrupting you while you're cleaning,\nbut please help me!"],["\\n<\\N[2]>……台所、せまくないですか？","","\\n<\\N[2]>...Your kitchen is a bit small, isn't it?"],["キバ猫背鬼Ｃ","","Kiba Hunchback Demon C"],["\\n<\\N[2]>おくつろぎのところすみません、\n助けて下さい！","","\\n<\\N[2]>Sorry for interrupting you while you're relaxing,\nbut please help me!"],["\\n<\\N[2]>頭が大きいとやはり\n首が疲れますか……？","","\\n<\\N[2]>If your head is big,\nthen does your neck get tired...?"],["縦長鬼Ｃ","","Vertical demon C"],["\\n<\\N[2]>調理中すみません、\n助けて下さい！","","\\n<\\N[2]>Sorry for interrupting you while you're cooking,\nbut please help me!"],["\\n<\\N[2]>何を料理されているのでしょうか？\\!\n私には様子が見えないので……","","\\n<\\N[2]>What are you cooking?\\!\nI can't see what's going on..."],["読込み用鬼１","","Reading demon 1"],["伽椰子ネタ","","Kayako story"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>最近公開されたホラー映画だと、\nこういうところからでも\nお化けに引きずり込まれるんだよねえ。\\!\nタンスから青鬼が出てくるのといい勝負。","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>In a recent horror movie,\nghosts can pull you in from places like this.\\!\nIt's right up there with an Ao Oni\npopping out of a closet."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>期待に応えてくれるねえ……\\!\nそこまでアタシ、設定したっけ……？？","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>They really lived up to my expectations...\\!\nDid I actually set things up that way...??"],["---------------------------------------------\n青鬼出ないときはメッセージを下に出す","","---------------------------------------------\nIf Blue Demon does not appear, post a message below."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>さっきの青鬼の現れかたは想定外だったなあ……\\.\\.\nなんでだろう？？","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>The way that oni appeared just now was totally unexpected...\\.\\.\nWhy, though??"],["読込み用鬼２","","Reading demon 2"],["EV019","","EV019"]],"context":[["Map011/events/1/name"],["Map011/events/2/name"],["Map011/events/2/pages/6/list/0/comment"],["Map011/events/3/name"],["Map011/events/3/pages/1/list/0/comment"],["Map011/events/5/name"],["Map011/events/5/pages/0/list/0/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map011/events/5/pages/0/list/3/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map011/events/5/pages/4/list/0/comment"],["Map011/events/5/pages/5/list/1/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map011/events/6/name"],["Map011/events/6/pages/0/list/1/message/hasPicture/top","Map011/events/7/pages/0/list/1/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map011/events/6/pages/1/list/2/message/hasPicture/top","Map011/events/7/pages/1/list/2/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map011/events/6/pages/1/list/7/message/hasPicture/top","Map011/events/7/pages/1/list/7/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map011/events/6/pages/1/list/12/message/hasPicture/top","Map011/events/7/pages/1/list/12/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map011/events/6/pages/1/list/17/message/hasPicture/top","Map011/events/7/pages/1/list/17/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map011/events/6/pages/1/list/22/message/hasPicture/top","Map011/events/7/pages/1/list/22/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map011/events/6/pages/1/list/27/message/hasPicture/top","Map011/events/7/pages/1/list/27/message/h