,\nbut please help me!"],["---------------------------\n青鬼が入ってきたら、\n助けてくれる処理","","---------------------------\nWhen the blue demon comes in,\nProcess that helps"],["\\n<\\N[2]>ありがとうございます！！","","\\n<\\N[2]>Thank you so much!!"],["\\n<\\N[2]> 失礼……","","\\n<\\N[2]>Rude..."],["\\n<\\N[2]> ……失礼しました！","","\\n<\\N[2]>...Excuse me!"],["鏡で呆然２号","","Stunned in the mirror #2"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号>ネズミちゃんがね……\\!\n私の髪で遊んでたのよ……\\!\nお化けが髪を持っていってしまうまで……","","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号>The little mouse...\\!\nIt was playing with my hair...\\!\nUntil a spirit came and took it away..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号>うふふふふ…………\\.…\\.…\\.\\.…\\|…","","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]Unit 2>Eheheheheh...\\....\\....\\.\\....\\|..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>まさかあんなに早く襲われるなんて……！？\\!\nんんー、どこでプログラム間違えたかな？","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]Unit 4>I never expected to be attacked so quickly...!\\!\nHmm. What did I screw up in the program?"]],"context":[["Map015/events/1/name"],["Map015/events/2/name"],["Map015/events/3/name"],["Map015/events/4/name"],["Map015/events/4/pages/1/list/6/message/hasPicture/bottom","Map015/events/5/pages/1/list/6/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map015/events/4/pages/4/list/2/message/noPicture/bottom","Map015/events/5/pages/4/list/2/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map015/events/5/name"],["Map015/events/6/name"],["Map015/events/6/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map015/events/6/pages/0/list/7/comment"],["Map015/events/7/name"],["Map015/events/7/pages/0/list/3/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map015/events/7/pages/0/list/7/comment"],["Map015/events/7/pages/0/list/21/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map015/events/7/pages/0/list/36/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map015/events/7/pages/0/list/45/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map015/events/8/name"],["Map015/events/8/pages/0/list/0/message/noPicture/bottom","Map015/events/8/pages/1/list/0/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map015/events/8/pages/0/list/7/message/noPicture/bottom","Map015/events/8/pages/1/list/7/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map015/event