\\n<\\N[2]>開かない":7,"開かない":8,"\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>こっちは寝室だったかな。開かないあたり、\n「ザ・密室」って感じ。":9,"青位置設定":10,"--------------------\n■デバッグモード":11,"--------------------":12,"EV007":13,"\\n<\\N[2]>屋根裏部屋の鍵を使った":14,"屋根裏部屋の鍵を使った":15,"\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>突入！　\\.\\.神妙にしろぃ！　\\!\n……なんちゃって♪":16,"鍵が掛かっている":17,"\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>おっと、アタシとしたことが鍵忘れたよ。\nデータだと、たしか１階の……":18,"EV008":19,"ランダム青出現設定":20},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map020","basename":"Map020.json","path":"data/Map020.json","relPath":"data/Map020.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":true,"progress":{"translated":21,"length":21,"percent":100},"cellInfo":[]},"data/Map021.json":{"data":[["青鬼","","Ao Oni"],["上向き画像を先読みに利用","","Use upward-facing images for look-ahead"],["\\","","\\"],["DiscardCharacter !ao4_tokage","","DiscardCharacter !ao4_tokage"],["DiscardCharacter !ao4_tokage_s","","DiscardCharacter !ao4_tokage_s"],["DiscardCharacter !$ao3_action","","DiscardCharacter !$ao3_action"],["DiscardCharacter !$ao5","","DiscardCharacter !$ao5"],["DiscardCharacter !$ao6","","DiscardCharacter !$ao6"],["DiscardCharacter !$ao7","","DiscardCharacter !$ao7"],["DiscardCharacter !$ao9","","DiscardCharacter !$ao9"],["DiscardCharacter !$ao10","","DiscardCharacter !$ao10"],["DiscardCharacter !$ao11","","DiscardCharacter !$ao11"],["DiscardCharacter !$ao12","","DiscardCharacter !$ao12"],["DiscardCharacter !$ao_m","","DiscardCharacter !$ao_m"],["---------------------\n■プレイヤー（コミカル）の設定","","---------------------\n■Player (comical) settings"],["--------------------------\n以下、ふうきゅう編集","","--------------------------\nThe following is edited by Fuukyu"],["\\n<\\N[2]>化け物だ！\n襲われるー！！","","\\n<\\N[2]>It's a monster!\nIt's attacking!!"],["\\n<マグマ>また館の外まで追ってきおって！！","","\\n<マグマ> Follow me outside the mansion again! !"],["\\n<技術者>「『捕食ひろしくん』、\n緊急停止コード、受付けません！！\\!\nマグマ様！！","","\\n<技術者> “'Hiroshi Hiroshi-kun',\nEmergency stop codes will not be accepted! ! \\!\nLord Magma! !"],["\\n<マグマ>とくぎ・『ダイフンガー！』","","\\n<マグマ> Tokugi・``Daifunga! ”"],["\n------------------------\n青鬼爆散。\nサスケさん移植イベント","","\n------------------------\nBlue demon explosion.\nSasuke-san transplant event"],["DiscardPicture ao_cm_dead_p1","","DiscardPicture ao_cm_dead_p1"],["DiscardPicture ao_cm_dead_p2","","DiscardPicture ao_cm_dead_p2"],["DiscardPicture ao_cm_dead_p3","","DiscardPicture ao_cm_dead_p3"],["DiscardPicture ao_cm_dead_p4","","DiscardPicture ao_cm_dead_p4"],["DiscardPicture ao_cm_dead_p5","","DiscardPicture ao_cm_dead_p5"],["\n青鬼爆散イベントここまで\n------------------------------","","\nAo Oni explosion event so far\n------------------------------"],["\\n<\\N[2]>助かったよ！","","\\n<\\N[2]> That helped!"],["\\n<マグマ>これで何体めか……\n老骨にこたえるわい","","\\n<マグマ> How many bodies are there...\nReplying to my old bones"],["\\n<技術者>何度調整してもプログラムが\n勝手に書き換わって暴走してしまいます。\\!\nやはりこのプロジェクトは……","","\\n<技術者> No matter how many times I adjust the program, the program will not work.\nIt gets rewritten without permission and goes out of control. \\!\nAfter all, this project..."],["\\n<マグマ>呪いなんぞに孫の喜ぶ顔を\n阻まれてたまるか！！\\!\nなんとしても原因を突き止めろ！！","","\\n<マグマ> Even though it's a curse, I want to see my grandchild's happy face.\nI can't stand being blocked! ! \\!\nFind the cause no matter what! !"],["\\n<技術者>今日のテストは\nゲームオーバーにならずに済ませたか。\nよく帰ってきてくれた。","","\\n<技術者>Today's test is\nDid you make it through without getting a game over?\nThank you for coming back."],["\\n<技術者>先にメンテナンスに戻ろう。","","\\n<技術者>Let's go back to maintenance first."],["\\n<\\N[2]>あの……。\\.\\.木下さん……。","","\\n<\\N[2]>Um... \\.\\. Mr. Kinoshita..."],["\n------------------------------\nここから暗転シーン","","\n------------------------------\nDark scene starts here"],["町外れにある無人の館\\!\nそこにはお化けが出るという噂があった","","An uninhabited mansion on the outskirts of town \\!\nThere were rumors that there were ghosts there."],["……という設定の新アトラクションが、\nオニヅカエンターテイメントの運営する\nテーマパークに誕生しようとしていた","","A new attraction with a setting of...\nOperated by Onizuka Entertainment\nIt was about to be born in a theme park."],["とある有名ホラーゲームの世界観を\n再現するというそれは、汎用腹話術人形型ロボット\n『ひろしくん』たちによってテストが\n進められていたが……","","The worldview of a certain famous horror game\nThe thing that is being reproduced is a general-purpose ventriloquist doll type robot.\nThe test was conducted by ``Hiroshi-kun'' and his friends.\nIt was progressing..."],["いわくつく、いわくつかない、\nあれやこれやのトラブルに\n関係者は悩まされ続けていた……","","I'm excited, I'm not excited,\nFor all sorts of troubles\nThose involved continued to be troubled..."],["当該プロジェクトが日の目を見たかどうかは、\n今や知るよしもない……","","Whether the project saw the light of day or not\nThere's no way to know now..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>やっぱり、\n『町外れにある、お化けが出ると噂の無人の館』を\n再現しようとすると、ろくなことがないね","","\\n<\\N[2]> As expected,\n``A deserted mansion on the outskirts of town that is rumored to be haunted''\nIf I try to reproduce it, I'll have a bad time."],["\\n<\\N[2]>今回のことでそれがよくわかったよ","","\\n<\\N[2]>This incident made me understand that."],["\\n<\\N[2]>ダイブ痛ンジャッタ……","","\\n<\\N[2]> Dive Pain Jatta..."],["\nコミカル編クレジット：\n\n","","\nComical version credits:"],["\n素材加工・素材制作　　　…ふうきゅう\nシナリオアレンジ・演出　…ふうきゅう\n新規効果音　　　　　　　…効果音ラボ","","\nMaterial processing/material production...Fukyu\nScenario arrangement/direction...Fukyuu\nNew sound effects...Sound Effects Lab"],["寄り道をされる際は、\n主人公の名前を\\C[2]コミカルムテキ\\C[0]にして\nお楽しみ下さい。","","When taking a detour,\nChange the main character's name to \\C[2] Comical Muteki \\C[0]\nPlease enjoy."],["----------------------","","----------------------"],["AooniAchievement start","","AooniAchievement start"],["AooniAchievement end","","AooniAchievement end"],["------------------------------------\n■プレイヤー（ハッカドール）の設定","","------------------------------------\n■Player (Hacka Doll) settings"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>つ、捕まる！！","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>-I'm caught! !"],["\\n<\\I[61] ？？？>伏せろ！！","","\\n<\\I[61] ？？？> Get down! !"],["--------------------------","","--------------------------"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>ゼロ姉、帽子のデータありがとうございますっ！\n青鬼に頭を世紀末にされたときはどうなることかと……！","","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号> Zero-nee, thank you for the hat data!\nI wonder what will happen when the blue demon turns my head into the end of the century...!"],["\\n<\\I[60] \\C[0]０号>ツクールＭＶのキャラ生成素材から借りてきた。\n修復までのつなぎにはなるだろう。","","Borrowed from the character generation material of \\n<\\I[60] \\C[0]０号> Maker MV.\nIt will serve as a bridge until repairs are made."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号>しょうがないわね……とりあえず帽子で応急処置……\\.\\.\nと言ったところかしら。","","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号> It can't be helped... I'll use a hat as a first aid measure... \\.\\.\nI guess that's what I said."],["\\n<\\I[60] \\C[0]０号>髪素材だとフィットに時間がかかるが、\n帽子ならすぐ使えるからな。","","\\n<\\I[60] \\C[0]０号> Hair material takes time to fit, but\nYou can use the hat right away."],["\\n<\\I[60] \\C[0]０号>その説明のために\nひとつだけ髪素材を持ってきたわけだが。\\.\\.\nいろいろ浮いて合わないだろう？　３号。","","\\n<\\I[60] \\C[0]０号> for that explanation\nI only brought one hair material. \\.\\.\nA lot of things don't fit together, right? No. 3."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号>合わない生え際を帽子でカバーしてみた件っ！！","","\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号> I tried covering the hairline that didn't suit me with a hat! !"],["\\n<\\I[60] \\C[0]０号>……まあ、遠目にはボロが分かりにくいから\nいいようなものだが……","","\\n<\\I[60] \\C[0]０号>...Well, it's hard to see the rags from a distance.\nIt seems like a good thing..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>その手がありましたか、３号ちゃん！\\.\\.　脱帽ですっ！！","","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号> Did you do that, No. 3-chan? \\.\\. Hats off! !"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号>脱毛はムダ毛だけで十分よ。\\.\\.１号ちゃん？","","\\n<\\I[\\V[84]] \\C[27]２号> Only unnecessary hair is enough for hair removal. \\.\\.1-chan?"],["\\n<\\I[60] \\C[0]０号>……２号。\\.\\.\nハッカドールシステムに戻ったら言語処理機能の検査だ。\\.\\.\\.いいな？","","\\n<\\I[60] \\C[0]０号>……No.2. \\.\\.\nReturning to the Hacka Doll system, it was time to test the language processing function. \\.\\.\\. Is it good?"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>あれ、４号ちゃんは？","","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号> What about No. 4?"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号>さっき、４号の悲鳴が\n建物の上を飛んでいったような気がするんだけど……","","\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号>I heard No. 4's scream just now.\nI feel like it flew over the building..."],["\\n<\\I[60] \\C[0]０号>まったく！　\\.\\.\nあいつは本当にいつもいつも手を焼かせる！","","\\n<\\I[60] \\C[0]０号> Absolutely! \\.\\.\nThat guy really always makes my hands hurt!"],["Ｃねずみ・１号","","C Mouse No. 1"],["Ｃねずみ・２号","","C Mouse No. 2"],["Ｃねずみ・３号","","C Mouse No. 3"],["Ｃねずみ・０号弾","","C Mouse/No. 0 bullet"],["Ｃひろし・４号","","C Hiroshi No. 4"],["技術者・０号","","Engineer/No.0"]],"context":[["Map021/events/1/name"],["Map021/events/1/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map021/events/2/name"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/1/Plugin Command"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/2/Plugin Command"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/3/Plugin Command"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/4/Plugin Command"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/5/Plugin Command"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/6/Plugin Command"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/7/Plugin Command"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/8/Plugin Command"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/9/Plugin Command"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/10/Plugin Command"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/11/Plugin Command"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/12/comment"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/23/comment"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/35/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/62/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/66/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/79/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/85/comment"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/119/Plugin Command"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/120/Plugin Command"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/121/Plugin Command"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/122/Plugin Command"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/123/Plugin Command"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/133/comment"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/144/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/146/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/153/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/164/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map021/events/2/pages/0/list/185