","------------------------------------\nDo not block the exit with a chair\nAdded processing.\nBe careful not to put it on the lower wall.\nI tried it"],["EV004","","EV004"],["EV005","","EV005"],["--------------------\n■椅子の上にのぼる","","--------------------\n■Climb on the chair"],["--------------------","","--------------------"],["\\n<\\N[2]>ライターオイルを手に入れた","","\\n<\\N[2]>I found the item, \"Lighter Fluid\"."],["DiscardCharacter !$oil","","DiscardCharacter !$oil"],["--------------------\n■椅子からおりる","","--------------------\n■Get off the chair"],["--------------------\n■それ以外の場合（椅子を動かしてしまう）","","--------------------\n■Other cases (moving the chair)"],["美香死体","","Mika corpse"],["美香","","Mika"],["\\n<美香>\\N[2]君……！","","\\n<Mika>\\N[2]...!"],["\\n<\\N[2]>無事でしたか……\\!\n他の皆は？","","\\n<\\N[2]>You're okay...!\\!\nWhere are the others?"],["\\n<美香>さぁ……\nはぐれてしまったから……","","\\n<Mika>I dunno...\nWe got separated..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>そうですか……","","\\n<\\N[2]>I see..."],["私と一緒に行きましょう","","Come with me"],["ここでじっとしていてください","","Wait here"],["\\n<美香>冗談じゃないわ！\n化け物のいる館を歩き回るなんて","","\\n<Mika>Are you kidding me!?\nI'm not walking around this mansion\nwith that monster loose."],["\\n<美香>わかったわ","","\\n<Mika>Alright, I'll wait here."],["\\n<美香>卓郎……","","\\n<Mika>Takuro..."],["----------------------\n■月のタリスマンを渡す","","----------------------\n■Give the moon talisman"],["\\n<\\N[2]>これを受け取ってください\n月のタリスマンです\n化け物からあなたを守ってくれるでしょう","","\\n<\\N[2]>Take this Moon Amulet.\nIt should protect you from the monster."],["\\n<美香>きれいね……\nありがとう……","","\\n<Mika>It's beautiful...\nThank you..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>卓郎と合流出来たらまた会いに来ます","","\\n<\\N[2]>If I find Takuro, I'll come back and get you."],["\\n<美香>分かったわ\nそれまでここでじっとしてる","","\\n<Mika>Alright, I'll be waiting here."],["----------------------\n■卓郎が亡くなったことを伝える","","----------------------\n■Tell them that Takuro has passed away."],["\\n<\\N[2]>……","","\\n<\\N[2]>..."],["卓郎の死を話す","","Tell her Takuro died"],["話さない","","Say nothing"],["-----------------------------\nやりとりをより自然に調整","","-----------------------------\nMake your interactions more natural"],["\\n<美香>…………\\!\nそんな……！\\!\n私も死んで卓郎に会いに行きたい……！","","\\n<Mika>......\\!\nThat can't be...!\\!\nI want to die now, so I can be with Takuro again...!"],["\\n<\\N[2]>悲しい事実ですが\nどうか一緒に来てくれませんか\\!\n出口が見つかりました","","\\n<\\N[2]>It's very sad,\nbut could you please come with me?\\!\nI found a way out."],["\\n<\\N[2]>卓郎も、あなたに生きていて欲しいと\n願っているはずです","","\\n<\\N[2]>Takuro would want you to survive.\nI'm sure of it."],["\\n<美香>……………………\\!\nそうね。\\.\\.卓郎の死を無駄に出来ない\\!\n一緒に行くわ","","\\n<Mika>............\\!\nOkay.\\.\\. I can't let Takuro's death be in vain.\\!\nI'll go with you."],["\\n<\\N[2]>美香が仲間になった","","\\n<\\N[2]>Mika joined the party."],["\\n<美香>卓郎、無事だったのね！","","\\n<Mika>Takuro, you're okay!"],["\\n<卓郎>まあな\\!\nさあ、一緒に行こうぜ","","\\n<Takuro>Pretty much.\\!\nLets go. Come with us."],["\\n<美香>……でも……本当に卓郎なの？\nなんだか雰囲気が違う気がする","","\\n<Mika>...But...is that really Takuro?\nSomething doesn't seem right about him."],["\\n<卓郎>おかしな奴だな\nさあ、一緒に行こうぜ","","\\n<Takuro>You're a funny girl.\nLets go. Come with us."],["\\n<美香>…………\\!もう少し、ここにいさせて","","\\n<Mika>......\\!Let me wait here a little longer."],["\\n<美香>……いやな予感がするの\\!\nもう少しここにいさせて","","\\n<Mika>...I have a bad feeling about this.\\!\nLet me wait here a little longer."],["\\n<卓郎>ああ、\\N[2]のおかげでな","","\\n<Takuro>Yeah, thanks to \\N[2]."],["\\n<美香>私も一緒に行くわ","","\\n<Mika>I'll go with you too."],["-------------------------------\n美香がここで生存中に青鬼と中に入ると、\n美香はベッド下など、どこかに避難している、\nという設定","","-------------------------------\nIf Mika goes inside with Ao Oni while she is still alive,\nMika has taken shelter somewhere, such as under the bed.\nThe setting"],["EV008","","EV008"],["--------------------\n■青鬼振り向くアニメ（2～11ページ使用）","","--------------------\n■Animation of Ao Oni turning around (pages 2 to 11 used)"],["アニメパターンをリセットすること","","Resetting the anime pattern"],["--------------------\n■青鬼出現","","--------------------\n■Blue demon appears"],["DiscardCharacter !$ao_mikakorosi","","DiscardCharac