"headerIndex":6,"headerParam":["normal",3,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":9,"headerParam":["normal",1,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":12,"headerParam":["normal",3,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":15,"headerParam":["normal",1,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":20,"headerParam":["normal",1,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":32,"headerParam":["normal",3,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":34,"headerParam":["normal",1,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":0,"headerParam":["-------------------------------"]}],null,[{"headerIndex":1,"headerParam":["--------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":33,"headerParam":["アニメパターンをリセットすること"]}],[{"headerIndex":37,"headerParam":["--------------------"]}],null,[{"headerIndex":0,"headerParam":["２～１１ページがアニメパターンです。"]}],null,null,[{"headerIndex":0,"headerParam":["--------------------"]}]],"indexIds":{"青":0,"EV002":1,"動かせるイス":2,"------------------------------------\n出口をイスでふさがないようにする\n処理を追加。\nあえて、下側のカベには寄せないように\nしてみた":3,"EV004":4,"EV005":5,"--------------------\n■椅子の上にのぼる":6,"--------------------":7,"\\n<\\N[2]>ライターオイルを手に入れた":8,"DiscardCharacter !$oil":9,"--------------------\n■椅子からおりる":10,"--------------------\n■それ以外の場合（椅子を動かしてしまう）":11,"美香死体":12,"美香":13,"\\n<美香>\\N[2]君……！":14,"\\n<\\N[2]>無事でしたか……\\!\n他の皆は？":15,"\\n<美香>さぁ……\nはぐれてしまったから……":16,"\\n<\\N[2]>そうですか……":17,"私と一緒に行きましょう":18,"ここでじっとしていてください":19,"\\n<美香>冗談じゃないわ！\n化け物のいる館を歩き回るなんて":20,"\\n<美香>わかったわ":21,"\\n<美香>卓郎……":22,"----------------------\n■月のタリスマンを渡す":23,"\\n<\\N[2]>これを受け取ってください\n月のタリスマンです\n化け物からあなたを守ってくれるでしょう":24,"\\n<美香>きれいね……\nありがとう……":25,"\\n<\\N[2]>卓郎と合流出来たらまた会いに来ます":26,"\\n<美香>分かったわ\nそれまでここでじっとしてる":27,"----------------------\n■卓郎が亡くなったことを伝える":28,"\\n<\\N[2]>……":29,"卓郎の死を話す":30,"話さない":31,"-----------------------------\nやりとりをより自然に調整":32,"\\n<美香>…………\\!\nそんな……！\\!\n私も死んで卓郎に会いに行きたい……！":33,"\\n<\\N[2]>悲しい事実ですが\nどうか一緒に来てくれませんか\\!\n出口が見つかりました":34,"\\n<\\N[2]>卓郎も、あなたに生きていて欲しいと\n願っているはずです":35,"\\n<美香>……………………\\!\nそうね。\\.\\.卓郎の死を無駄に出来ない\\!\n一緒に行くわ":36,"\\n<\\N[2]>美香が仲間になった":37,"\\n<美香>卓郎、無事だったのね！":38,"\\n<卓郎>まあな\\!\nさあ、一緒に行こうぜ":39,"\\n<美香>……でも……本当に卓郎なの？\nなんだか雰囲気が違う気がする":40,"\\n<卓郎>おかしな奴だな\nさあ、一緒に行こうぜ":41,"\\n<美香>…………\\!もう少し、ここにいさせて":42,"\\n<美香>……いやな予感がするの\\!\nもう少しここにいさせて":43,"\\n<卓郎>ああ、\\N[2]のおかげでな":44,"\\n<美香>私も一緒に行くわ":45,"-------------------------------\n美香がここで生存中に青鬼と中に入ると、\n美香はベッド下など、どこかに避難している、\nという設定":46,"EV008":47,"--------------------\n■青鬼振り向くアニメ（2～11ページ使用）":48,"アニメパターンをリセットすること":49,"--------------------\n■青鬼出現":50,"DiscardCharacter !$ao_mikakorosi":51,"２～１１ページがアニメパターンです。":52,"青ルート補正":53,"青位置設定":54,"--------------------\n■デバッグモード":55},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map025","basename":"Map025.json","path":"data/Map025.json","relPath":"data/Map025.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":true,"progress":{"translated":56,"length":56,"percent":100},"cellInfo":[]},"data/Map026.json":{"data":[["ドア","","door"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>本編だとドアだけがある壁だね。\\!\nデータ上は存在してないけど、\n奥への入口があったりすると、おもしろいんだけどなあ。","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>In the main story, it's a wall with only a door. \\!\nAlthough it does not exist in the data,\nIt would be interesting if there was an entrance to the back."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>さっきは驚いたなあ……。\\.\\.\n青鬼の通い路でもあるの？　\\.\\.ここ……。","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> I was surprised just now... \\.\\.\nIs it also the path of the blue demon? \\.\\. Here..."],["ドアノブと青通い路","","doorknob and blue road"],["-----------------------------------\n青鬼胎内からここに出てくる","","-----------------------------------\nAo Oni comes out here from the womb."],["------------------------------------------\nフワッティーモードのときは、\n追ってくる鬼を必ずフワッティーにする","","------------------------------------------\nWhen in floaty mode,\nAlways make the chasing demon fluffy"],["--------------------","","--------------------"],["青","","blue"],["EV004","","EV004"],["EV005","","EV005"],["タンス","","chest of drawers"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>アテにならない避難所（タンス）は、\nい～ずこっ、\\.\\.と。","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>The shelter (chest) that will not be used is\nI-Zuko, \\.\\.."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>コミカルの方にないのは分かってるけど、\n家具もあったりなかったりなんて、\nお化け屋敷は家具までお化けなのかな？","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> I know it's not in the comical version, but\nThere may or may not be furniture,\nIs even the furniture in a haunted house haunted?"],["---------------------------------------------\n青鬼出ないときはメッセージを下に出す","","---------------------------------------------\nIf Blue Demon does not appear, post a message below."],["-------------------------","","-------------------------"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>ちょ、\\.\\.このアタシに壁ドンする気！？","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> Hey, \\.\\. I'm going to wallop this guy! ?"],["EV007","","EV007"],["--------------------\n■たんすの扉を開けて中に入る","","--------------------\n■Open the door of the chest of drawers and go inside."],["--------------------\n■たんすの扉を開けて出る","","--------------------\n■Open the door of the chest of drawers and exit"],["卓郎","","Takuro"],["本編イベント","","Main event"],["\\n<卓郎>\\N[2]！\n無事だったか！","","\\n<Takuro>\\N[2]!\nYou're okay!"],["\\n<\\N[2]>ええ、何とか","","\\n<\\N[2]>Yeah, I guess."],["\\n<卓郎>\\N[2]……！\\!\nお前も見たのか？\nあの化け物を……","","\\n<Takuro>\\N[2]...! \\!\nDid you see it too?\nThat monster..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>ええ、\\!\nにわかには信じがたいことです\nあのような生物が存在するなど……","","\\n<\\N[2]>Yeah, \\!\nIt's so unbelievable\nto think that a creature like that exists..."],["\\n<卓郎>出入口は全部ふさがれてる\\!\n閉じ込められちまったんだ……オレ達","","\\n<Takuro>All the exits are blocked. \\!\nWe're trapped in here..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>そのようですね……","","\\n<\\N[2]>It would seem so..."],["\\n<卓郎>手分けして探索しよう\nオレは一階を見てくる","","\\n<Takuro>Let's split up and look around.\nI'll check the first floor."],["\\n<\\N[2]>よろしくお願いします","","\\n<\\N[2]>Okay, good luck..."],["EV010","","EV010"],["\\n<\\N[2]>玄関の鍵を手に入れた","","\\n<\\N[2]>I found the item, \"Entrance Key\"."],["玄関の鍵を手に入れた","","got the key to the door"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>さてさて。そろそろみんなを連れて\nおさらばしようかね。","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> Well now. It's time to bring everyone\nLet's say goodbye."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>青鬼の調整も\nしないといけないみたいだし……","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> Ao Oni adjustment also\nLooks like I have to..."],["たけしＣ・３号","","Takeshi C.3"],["卓郎Ｃ・１号・ハゲ３号","","Takuro C.1, Bald No.3"],["\\n<\\N[2]>みんな！　無事だったか！","","\\n<\\N[2]> Everyone! Was it okay?"],["\\n<卓郎>何とかな","","\\n<卓郎> Something like that"],["\\n<たけし>おい\\N[2]\nあの化け物は一体何なんだ？\nお前ならわかるはずだろ？","","\\n<たけし> Hey \\N[2]\nWhat on earth is that monster?\nYou should understand, right?"],["\\n<\\N[2]>さぁ……\nにわかには信じがたいことです\nあのような生物が存在するなど……","","\\n<\\N[2]>Now...\nIt's hard to believe all of a sudden\nThat such creatures exist..."],["\\n<たけし>クソッ！\n俺たちはもうおしまいだ！\n全員あの化け物にケツから食われちまうんだ\nそうに決まってる！","","\\n<たけし> Shit!\nWe're done!\nWe're all going to get eaten in the ass by that monster.\nIt's certain!"],["\\n<卓郎>落ち着くんだたけし！\n助かる方法は必ずあるさ\nそうだろ？","","\\n<卓郎> Calm down, Takeshi!\nThere's always a way to help\nIsn't that so?"],["--------------------\n■青鬼出現、卓郎を殺す","","--------------------\n■Aoki appears and kills Takuro"],["----------------------------\n■首に青鬼風の花が咲く","","----------------------------\n■Aoki-style flowers bloom on your neck."],["--------------------\n■逃げ出す","","--------------------\n■Escape"],["\\n<\\N[2]>何てこった！\n卓郎が（ショックで）殺されちゃった！","","\\n<\\N[2]> Oh my god!\nTakuro was (shocked) killed!"],["\\n<たけし>この人でなし！","","\\n<たけし> Not this person!"],["------------------------------------------","","------------------------------------------"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>み、みんなぁ〜、\\.\\.無事だった？","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> Hey, everyone~, \\.\\. Are you okay?"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号>……あれ青鬼だよね？ \\.\\.\\.ゼロ姉の服着てたけど……。\\!\n４号ならわかる？","","\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号>...That's a blue demon, right? \\.\\.\\.I was wearing Zero sister's clothes... \\!\nDo you understand if it's number 4?"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>ん～と。\\.\\.アタシの調べだと、青鬼は誰かを食べると、\nその人間の特徴をコピーするみたいだけど。","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>Hmm. \\.\\.According to my research, when a blue demon eats someone,\nIt's like copying the characteristics of that person."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>あのゼロ姉が、おいそれと青鬼に捕まるはずないし……\\!\n身体を拡大させて青鬼の覆面でもしてたりとか。","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> There's no way that Zero-nee would be captured by the Blue Demon... \\!\nHe expanded his body and wore the mask of a blue demon."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号>ゼロ姉が？　顔を青鬼にして？？","","\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号> Zero sister? Turn your face into a blue demon? ?"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>なぜわたしたちを追いかけて襲うんですかっ！？","","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>Why are you chasing us and attacking us!? ?"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>（タネあかしには、まだ早いし……）","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> (It's still too early to prove the seeds...)"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>あぁ、\\.\\.\\.とうとうあんたたちに愛想が尽きたことを\n思い知らせるためだったりして！","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>Ah, \\.\\.\\.I've finally run out of love for you guys.\nMaybe it was to remind me!"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>ふえぇ～ん！！　\\.\\.きっとそうですっ！","","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号> Huh! ! \\.\\. I'm sure so!"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>わたしたちいつもドジばっかりしてるから見捨てられたんですっ！","","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>We were abandoned because we were always clumsy!"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>（あっ……）","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> (Ah...)"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>きっとまとめてスクラップにしに来たんですっ！\\!\nだから身も心も鬼なんですっ！","","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号> I'm sure they came here to scrap everything! \\!\nThat's why my body and mind are demons!"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>うわああああ～～～～ん！！","","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号> Wow! !"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>あ、あはは…。ゼロ姉、怒りはするけど、\nスクラップだなんてそんな、ねぇ……","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>Ah, ahaha…. Zero-nee, I'm angry, but\nIt's not like it's a scrap..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号>そうだよ〜。\\.\\.きっと２号がなんかゼロ姉を怒らせるような何かを……","","\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号> That's right. \\.\\. I'm sure No. 2 did something to make Zero-nee angry..."],["-------------------------------------------\n青鬼現る。\n\nぽんと３号の髪をつかむと、麺のようにすすり食った。\n口元にはすすりそびれた髪が垂れ下がっている","","-------------------------------------------\nA blue demon appears.\n\nHe grabbed No. 3 by the hair and slurped it up like noodles.\nA loose piece of hair hangs around his mouth"],["----------------------------------------","","----------------------------------------"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>３号ちゃん！！","","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号> No. 3-chan! !"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号>ない！！　\\.\\.ない！！　\\.\\.ぼくの髪がない！！","","\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号> No! ! \\.\\. not found! ! \\.\\. I don't have any hair! !"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>ひ、\\.\\.ひどすぎますっ！！\\!　\n髪は男の娘（こ）にとっても命なんですよっ？！\\!\nそれをラーメンみたいに！！","","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>H-\\.\\.It's terrible! ! \\!　\nHair is life for boys and girls, right? ! \\!\nMake it like ramen! !"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>うわぁ～～んっ！！　\\.\\.\\.ゼロ姉のハカでなし～～～っ！！","","\\n<\\I[\\V[83]] \\C[6]１号>Wow! ! \\.\\.\\. Zero sister's haka de nashi! !"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>い、\\.\\.１号、\\.\\.とにかく逃げよう！？","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> No. \\.\\.1, \\.\\. Just run away! ?"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>（予想より青鬼の出現が早いような……？？）","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> (It seems like the blue demon appears earlier than expected...??)"],["\\n<\\N[2]>花瓶にされてしまうとは……","","\\n<\\N[2]> Being turned into a vase..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号>もしボクが出家したら、仏（ブッツ）ドール、\\.\\.\nもしくは寺生まれのTさんみたいな破ァッカドールになっちゃうんだ……","","\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号>If I became a monk, I would become a Butsu doll, \\.\\.\nOr you'll turn into a broken doll like Mr. T, who was born in a temple..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号>ななみん……、\\.\\.ななみん……","","\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号> Nanamin..., \\.\\. Nanamin..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>３号、もしかしてショートしてる？？","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>3, maybe there is a short circuit? ?"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>あとで連れてくか……\\.\\.\n髪さえなければ襲われないはずだし……","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> I'll take you with me later...\\.\\.\nIf you don't have hair, you shouldn't be attacked..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号>ぼく、ここから脱出したら、ななみんのお渡し会に行くんだ…………","","\\n<\\I[\\V[85]] \\C[4]３号>When I escape from here, I'm going to Nanamin's handover party..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>今度お渡し会の時間、調べといてあげるから！！","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>I'll check the time for the next handover event! !"],["EV013","","EV013"],["EV014","","EV014"],["青位置設定","","blue position setting"],["--------------------\n■デバッグモード","","--------------------\n■Debug mode"],["-------------------------------\nハッカドール編イベント用","","-------------------------------\nFor Hacka Doll event"],["青鬼イベント用","","For Ao Oni event"],["画像の先読み用イベントです。","","This is an event for prefetching images."]],"context":[["Map026/events/1/name"],["Map026/events/1/pages/5/list/5/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map026/events/1/pages/5/list/12/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map026/events/2/name"],["Map026/events/2/pages/3/list/3/comment"],["Map026/events/2/pages/3/list/70/comment"],["Map026/events/2/pages/3/list/78/comment","Map026/events/7/pages/0/list/15/comment","Map026/events/7/pages/0/list/31/comment","Map026/events/7/pages/1/list/21/comment","Map026/events/7/pages/1/list/41/comment","Map026/events/15/pages/0/list/25/comment"],["Map026/events/3/name"],["Map026/events/4/name"],["Map026/events/5/name"],["Map026/events/6/name"],["Map026/events/6/pages/6/list/10/message/noPicture/top","Map026/events/6/pages/6/list/23/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map026/events/6/pages/6/list/14/message/noPicture/top","Map026/events/6/pages/6/list/27/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map026/events/6/pages/6/list/21/comment"],["Map026/events/6/pages/6/list/39/comment"],["Map026/events/6/pages/6/list/78/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map026/events/7/name"],["Map026/events/7/pages/0/list/1/comment","Map026/events/7/pages/1/list/7/comment"],["Map026/events/7/pages/0/list/17/comment","Map026/events/7/pages/1/list/27/comment"],["Map026/events/8/name"],["Map026/events/9/name"],["Map026/events/9/pages/1/list/14/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map026/events/9/pages/1/list/17/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map026/events/9/pages/1/list/19/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map026/events/9/pages/1/list/23/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map026/events/9/pages/1/list/27/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map026/events/9/pages/1/