それらの表示を行わない改変を行った。":3,"--------------------\n■謎の男、再び":4,"--------------------\n■謎の男アニメーション":5,"DiscardPicture t1":6,"DiscardPicture t2":7,"DiscardPicture t3":8,"DiscardCharacter !$148-Storekeeper02":9,"--------------------\n■迫る青鬼アニメーション":10,"DiscardPicture semaruao1":11,"DiscardPicture semaruao2":12,"DiscardPicture semaruao3":13,"DiscardPicture semaruao4":14,"DiscardPicture semaruao5":15,"--------------------\n■消える":16,"EV003":17},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map031","basename":"Map031.json","path":"data/Map031.json","relPath":"data/Map031.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":true,"progress":{"translated":18,"length":18,"percent":100},"cellInfo":[]},"data/Map032.json":{"data":[["EV001","","EV001"],["青","","blue"],["EV003","","EV003"],["EV004","","EV004"],["\\n<\\N[2]>絵本を手に入れた","","\\n<\\N[2]>I found the item, \"Picture Book\"."],["EV005","","EV005"],["EV006","","EV006"],["EV007","","EV007"],["EV008","","EV008"],["青位置設定","","blue position setting"],["--------------------\n■デバッグモード","","--------------------\n■Debug mode"],["--------------------","","--------------------"]],"context":[["Map032/events/1/name"],["Map032/events/2/name"],["Map032/events/3/name"],["Map032/events/4/name"],["Map032/events/4/pages/0/list/3/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map032/events/5/name"],["Map032/events/6/name"],["Map032/events/7/name"],["Map032/events/8/name"],["Map032/events/9/name"],["Map032/events/9/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map032/events/9/pages/0/list/7/comment"]],"tags":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["blue"],["blue"]],"parameters":[null,null,null,null,[{"headerIndex":3,"headerParam":["normal",0,0,2]}],null,null,null,null,null,[{"headerIndex":0,"headerParam":["--------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":7,"headerParam":["--------------------"]}]],"indexIds":{"EV001":0,"青":1,"EV003":2,"EV004":3,"\\n<\\N[2]>絵本を手に入れた":4,"EV005":5,"EV006":6,"EV007":7,"EV008":8,"青位置設定":9,"--------------------\n■デバッグモード":10,"--------------------":11},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map032","basename":"Map032.json","path":"data/Map032.json","relPath":"data/Map032.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":true,"progress":{"translated":12,"length":12,"percent":100},"cellInfo":[]},"data/Map033.json":{"data":[["EV001","","EV001"],["----------------------------------\n■全員生還＋ジェイルハウス沈黙","","----------------------------------\n■Everyone survives + Jailhouse silence"],["球体に姿を変えた化け物は空の彼方へ去っていった。\\!\nあの緑の鍵と、化け物の間にはどんな関係があったのか。\\!\nそれらは、\\.\\.今なお謎のままだ。","","The monster transformed into a sphere and disappeared into the sky. \\!\nWhat kind of relationship was there between that green key and the monster? \\!\nThey \\.\\.still remain a mystery."],["……そして……","","...and..."],["----------------------------------\n■それ以外","","----------------------------------\n■Others"],["必死で走っているうちに街へ出た\\!\n化け物はもう追ってきてはいなかった","","I ran and ran, until I got back to town.\\!\nThe monster was no longer following me."],["--------------------\n■全員生還時","","--------------------\n■When everyone returns alive"],["全員で繁華街にたどり着いたときには皆無口だった","","When we all arrived at the downtown area, everyone was silent."],["--------------------\n■それ以外（従来ＥＤ）","","--------------------\n■Others (conventional ED)"],["--------------------------------\n４号モノローグエンド\n\n--------------------------------","","--------------------------------\nNo. 4 monologue end\n\n--------------------------------"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>その日、アタシは「青鬼」世界の\nジェイルハウスを訪れていた。","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>That day, I was in the \"Blue Demon\" world.\nHe was visiting the jail house."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>そこを、多くの人が楽しめる\nお化け屋敷として生まれ変わらせるため、\n一部データを改変して実際に足を運んだ\nところだったのだ。","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>Many people can enjoy it\nIn order to be reborn as a haunted house,\nI made some changes to the data and actually visited the site.\nBy the way, that's it."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>だが、そこでアタシを待ち受けていたのは、\n改変したデータを退け、\n強い意志で襲い来る「青鬼」だった。","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>, but what was waiting for me there was,\nDiscard the modified data,\nIt was a \"blue demon\" that attacked with a strong will."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>ともに訪れた仲間たちが\n髪（いのち）を奪われ、泣き叫び、\n思考回路をショートさせていった……","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>The friends who visited with us\nMy hair (life) was taken away and I cried out,\nI short-circuited my thought circuit..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>アタシはからくも、偶然和室で寝ていた\n木ノ下さんに助けてもらった。\\!\n青鬼化して、しかも目を開いて寝たまま（魚かよ）で、\\.\\.\nというのには驚いたが……","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> I happened to be sleeping in a Japanese-style room.\nMr. Kinoshita helped me. \\!\n\\.\\. He turned into a blue demon and was still sleeping with his eyes open (Is it a fish?)\nI was surprised..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>……いや、\\.\\.彼が寝ぼけていなかったら、\n襲われていたのは自分だったかもしれない。","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>...No, \\.\\. If he wasn't half asleep,\nI might have been the one being attacked."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>館の外まで逃げたとき、\n“破ァ”\\.\\.とも\\.\\.“喝（カァツ）”\\.\\.ともとれる声が、館から聞こえた。\\!\n誰のものだろうか……？　","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>When I ran away from the building,\nA voice that could be interpreted as “Breaking” \\.\\. or \\.\\. or “Katsu” \\.\\. was heard from the mansion. \\!\nWho does it belong to...?　"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>\nその後アタシは……","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>\nAfter that, I..."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>騒動の原因を作った責任で、\n本物のゼロ姉に髪のデータを\n取り上げられてしまった。","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> Responsible for causing the uproar,\nHair data for the real Zero sister\nIt was taken away."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>\nしばらく返してもらえそうにない……","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>\nI don't think I'll get it back for a while..."],["--------------------------------\nクレジット\n\n--------------------------------","","--------------------------------\ncredit\n\n--------------------------------"],["\nハッカドール編・クレジット\n\n","","\nHacka Doll Edition/Credit"],["\nシナリオ　　　　…ふうきゅう\nシナリオ監修　　…ハッカドールチーム（DeNA）","","\nScenario...fuukyu\nScenario supervision: Hacka Doll Team (DeNA)"],["\n素材制作　　　　…合同会社イクシール\n素材加工　　　　…ふうきゅう\n新規効果音　　　…効果音ラボ","","\nMaterial production…Ixeal LLC\nMaterial processing...Fukyu\nNew sound effects...Sound Effects Lab"],["　主人公の名前を\\C[14]ヒカットール\\C[0]にすると、\n　ハゲの目隠し（青帯）に暇を出せます。\n　また、無敵モードの有無も選べます。","","If the main character's name is \\C[14] Hikattor \\C[0],\nYou can spend time blindfolding your bald person (blue belt).\nYou can also choose whether or not to use invincibility mode."],["----------------------","","----------------------"],["AooniAchievement prepare","","AooniAchievement prepare"],["AooniAchievement start","","AooniAchievement start"],["AooniAchievement end","","AooniAchievement end"],["４号ＥＤ","","No. 4 ED"],["０号ＥＤ","","No. 0 ED"]],"context":[["Map033/events/1/name"],["Map033/events/1/pages/0/list/2/comment"],["Map033/events/1/pages/0/list/6/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map033/events/1/pages/0/list/11/message/noPicture/middle","Map033/events/1/pages/0/list/34/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map033/events/1/pages/0/list/17/comment"],["Map033/events/1/pages/0/list/22/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map033/events/1/pages/0/list/26/comment"],["Map033/events/1/pages/0/list/31/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map033/events/1/pages/0/list/44/comment"],["Map033/events/1/pages/1/list/0/comment"],["Map033/events/1/pages/1/list/6/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map033/events/1/pages/1/list/9/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map033/events/1/pages/1/list/14/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map033/events/1/pages/1/list/18/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map033/events/1/pages/1/list/22/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map033/events/1/pages/1/list/27/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map033/events/1/pages/1/list/30/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map033/events/1/pages/1/list/34/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map033/events/1/pages/1/list/107/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map033/events/1/pages/1/list/111/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map033/events/1/pages/1/list/115/comment"],[