------------\n■次の会話","","--------------------\n■Next conversation"],["\\n<\\N[2]>たけし！　無事でしたか！","","\\n<\\N[2]>Takeshi! You're okay!"],["\\n<たけし>ああ……\nだが時間の問題さ\nいずれ化け物に捕まっちまう\\!\n逃げ場なんてないんだよ……","","\\n<Takeshi>Yeah...\nBut it's just a matter of time\nuntil I get caught by that monster.\\!\nThere's nowhere to run..."],["\\n<たけし>オレが……\\!\nオレがお化け屋敷に行こうなんて言わなけりゃ\nこんなことにはならなかったんだ……\\!\nオレが……\\!オレのせいで…………","","\\n<Takeshi>If only I...\\!\nIf only I hadn't suggested we come here.\nWe wouldn't be in this mess...\\!\nIt's...\\! It's all my fault..."],["--------------------\n■星のタリスマンを持っていれば渡す","","--------------------\n■If you have the Star Talisman, give it to him."],["\\n<\\N[2]>星のタリスマンを差し上げます\nこれを握って一度深呼吸してください","","\\n<\\N[2]> I will give you a star talisman.\nHold this and take a deep breath"],["\\n<たけし>あ……ありがとう\\!\n……スー……\\!ハー……","","\\n<たけし> Ah...Thank you \\!\n... Sue... \\! Ha..."],["\\n<たけし>……なんだろう、落ち着いたぜ……","","\\n<Takeshi>... I don't know what this thing is,\nbut I feel better now..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>これからは一緒に行動しましょう","","\\n<\\N[2]>Let's act together from now on"],["\\n<たけし>……そうだな","","\\n<たけし>...That's right."],["\\n<\\N[2]>たけしが仲間になった","","\\n<\\N[2]>Takeshi has joined the party."],["たけしは走らないが、他のスイッチとの兼ね合いを考慮し\nこのスイッチもONにする","","Takeshi does not run, but considering the balance with other switches\nTurn on this switch as well"],["--------------------\n■出ていくたけし","","--------------------\n■Takeshi leaving"],["--------------------\n■たけしの悲鳴","","--------------------\n■Takeshi's scream"],["\\n<たけし>うわぁ―――――！！","","\\n<Takeshi>Ahhhhhhhhhhhhh!!"],["\\n<\\N[2]>たけし！","","\\n<\\N[2]> Takeshi!"],["--------------------\n■プレイヤー、移動","","--------------------\n■Player, move"],["青ルート補正","","blue route correction"],["青位置設定","","blue position setting"],["--------------------\n■デバッグモード","","--------------------\n■Debug mode"],["ランダム青出現設定","","Random blue appearance setting"]],"context":[["Map045/events/1/name"],["Map045/events/2/name"],["Map045/events/3/name"],["Map045/events/3/pages/1/