-------------------":12,"ao":13,"ランダム青出現設定":14},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map050","basename":"Map050.json","path":"data/Map050.json","relPath":"data/Map050.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":true,"progress":{"translated":15,"length":15,"percent":100},"cellInfo":[]},"data/Map051.json":{"data":[["青","","blue"],["出入り口","","doorway"],["タンス","","chest of drawers"],["EV004","","EV004"],["--------------------\n■たんすの扉を開けて中に入る","","--------------------\n■Open the door of the chest of drawers and go inside."],["--------------------","","--------------------"],["--------------------\n■たんすの扉を開けて出る","","--------------------\n■Open the door of the chest of drawers and exit"],["ao","","ao"],["青鬼タンス出現処理","","Blue demon chest appearance process"],["--------------------\n■たんすから青鬼が出てくる","","--------------------\n■A blue demon comes out of the chest of drawers."],["DiscardCharacter !$tansu_oni","","DiscardCharacter !$tansu_oni"],["青位置設定","","blue position setting"],["--------------------\n■デバッグモード","","--------------------\n■Debug mode"],["EV008","","EV008"],["画像先読み用です","","It is for image pre-reading."],["EV010","","EV010"],["--------------------------------------\n全員生存時のみ出現する金庫なので、\n卓郎関連の条件分岐はカットできる\n（生存時はこの時点で必ずパーティにいるため）","","--------------------------------------\nIt's a safe that only appears when everyone is alive, so\nConditional branches related to Takuro can be cut\n(If you are alive, you will always be in the party at this point)"],["\\n<\\N[2]>こんなところに金庫が……。\\!\nしかし、ダイヤルが回りません。\nこれでは金庫の開けようがありませんね……","","\\n<\\N[2]> There's a safe somewhere like this... \\!\nHowever, the dial does not turn.\nThere's no way to open the safe with this..."],["\\n<卓郎>……………………。\\!\n金庫の底に何か書いてあるな","","\\n<卓郎>……………………. \\!\nThere's something written on the bottom of the safe."],["\\n<\\N[2]>『静かに眠る子供たちの頭を、そっとなでたい』","","\\n<\\N[2]> “I want to gently pat the heads of the children who are sleeping quietly.”"],["\\n<\\N[2]>金庫の底に、こう記されている。\\!\n『静かに眠る子供たちの頭を、そっとなでたい』","","The following is written at the bottom of the \\n<\\N[2]> safe. \\!\n“I want to gently pat the heads of children who are sleeping peacefully.”"],["--------------------------------\n冒頭で画像読込み処理","","--------------------------------\nImage loading process at the beginning"],["\\n<\\N[2]>金庫のフタが浮いていますが、開きませんね。\nどこか壊れているのでしょうか……？","","\\n<\\N[2]>The lid of the safe is floating, but it won't open.\nIs it broken somewhere...?"],["\\n<卓郎>せっかくの仕掛けもガタがきてるみたいだな。\\!\nそらよっと！","","\\n<卓郎>It seems like the mechanism is starting to wobble. \\!\nSora Yotto!"],["\\n<卓郎>もっと壊せばいいんだよ。","","\\n<卓郎> You should break it even more."],["\\n<\\N[2]>化け物に気づかれたらどうするのですか！？\\.\\.\n今の物音で！！","","\\n<\\N[2]>What will you do if a monster notices you? ? \\.\\.\nWith the current noise! !"],["\\n<卓郎>！！　\\.\\.悪かった！　\\.\\.思わず……\\!\nこんな状況なのに、気が大きくなっちまってた。\\!\nなんでだろうな……？","","\\n<卓郎>! ! \\.\\. That was bad! \\.\\. Involuntarily...\\!\nDespite the situation, I was getting anxious. \\!\nI wonder why...?"],["\\n<美香>その太陽の形のお守りのせいだったりして。\\!\n守る人をまちがえたんじゃないかしら。","","\\n<美香>Maybe it was because of that sun-shaped amulet. \\!\nI think I may have chosen the wrong person to protect it."],["\\n<たけし>カンベンしてくれよ……","","\\n<たけし> Please excuse me..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>写真の貼られたＩＣカードと、\n青い手帳を手に入れた。\\!\n手帳には一通り目も通した。","","\\n<\\N[2]> An IC card with a photo attached,\nI got a blue notebook. \\!\nI glanced through my notebook."],["\\n<\\N[2]>卓郎が投げた手提げ金庫も元の位置に戻した。","","\\n<\\N[2]> The handheld safe that Takuro threw was also returned to its original position."],["\\n<\\N[2]>ＩＣカードに写真とは。\nこれは、この館の家族でしょうか……？","","\\n<\\N[2]>What is a photo on an IC card?\nIs this the family of this mansion...?"],["\\n<\\N[2]>うまく開かなかったとはいえ、\nダイヤルがダミーの、無線解錠式の手提げ金庫ですか。\n珍しいものがあるものです……。","","\\n<\\N[2]>Although it did not open successfully,\nIs it a wireless unlockable portable safe with a dummy dial?\nThere are some rare things..."]],"context":[["Map051/events/1/name"],["Map051/events/2/name"],["Ma