この卓郎は青鬼が化けている設定。よって、ここには出ない。","","At this point, Takuro has already been killed by Ao Oni.\nThis Takuro is set to be a blue demon disguised. Therefore, I will not appear here."],["EV012","","EV012"],["EV013","","EV013"],["EV014","","EV014"],["EV015","","EV015"],["EV016","","EV016"],["EV017","","EV017"],["EV018","","EV018"],["EV019","","EV019"],["EV020","","EV020"],["EV021","","EV021"],["EV022","","EV022"],["EV023","","EV023"],["EV024","","EV024"],["EV025","","EV025"],["EV026","","EV026"],["EV027","","EV027"],["EV028","","EV028"],["EV029","","EV029"],["EV030","","EV030"],["EV031","","EV031"],["ボディービル青鬼の移動ルート（アニメーション）を設定します。","","Set the movement route (animation) of the bodybuilding blue demon."],["青ルート補正","","blue route correction"],["EV033","","EV033"],["青fuwatty","","blue fuwatty"],["ao11","","ao11"],["EV036","","EV036"],["EV037","","EV037"],["青ルート補正亜流","","Blue route correction variant"],["青位置設定","","blue position setting"],["--------------------\n■デバッグモード","","--------------------\n■Debug mode"],["--------------------","","--------------------"],["縦長鬼","","vertical demon"],["トカゲ鬼大","","Lizard Onidai"],["トカゲ鬼小","","lizard demon small"],["飛び鬼","","flying demon"],["アメーバ鬼","","amoeba demon"],["青鬼空間入口","","Blue demon space entrance"],["DiscardTilesets 4","","DiscardTilesets 4"],["DiscardTilesets 10","","DiscardTilesets 10"],["DiscardPicture kabe2","","DiscardPicture kabe2"],["DiscardPicture gaku_pic","","DiscardPicture gaku_pic"],["DiscardPicture piece1","","DiscardPicture piece1"],["DiscardPicture piece2","","DiscardPicture piece2"],["DiscardPicture piece3","","DiscardPicture piece3"]],"context":[["Map068/events/1/name"],["Map068/events/1/pages/2/list/3/Plugin Command","Map068/events/45/pages/0/list/9/Plugin Command"],["Map068/events/2/name"],["Map068/events/3/name"],["Map068/events/4/name"],["Map068/events/5/name"],["Map068/events/6/name"],["Map068/events/7/name"],["Map068/events/8/name"],["Map068/events/9/name"],["Map068/events/10/name"],["Map068/events/10/pages/0