\n<\\N[2]>月のタリスマンを手に入れた","","\\n<\\N[2]>I found the item, \"Moon Amulet\"."],["---------------------------------------------------\n■月のタリスマンの効果の有無を決める。\n　タイムアタックや連続逃走記録を競う場面で、\n　公平を期す場合に「無効」を選ぶ","","---------------------------------------------------\n■Determines whether the Moon Talisman has an effect or not.\nIn the scene of competing for time attack and consecutive escape records,\nChoose \"invalid\" if you want to be fair."],["\\>　　月のタリスマンを所持、または所持しているメンバーがいると、\n\\>　　特定の状態（青鬼が部屋にいるときにタンスに入るなど）\n\\>　　のときを除き、\\C[23]タンスでの青鬼回避率がアップ\\C[0]します。","","If you or a party member possess the Moon Talisman and the effect is\nenabled, situationally, (such as when an oni is already in the room)\n\\C[23]hiding in a closet will be more likely to work\\C[0]."],["\\C[24]この効果を有効にする（推奨）","","\\C[24]Enable (Recommended)"],["この効果を無効にする","","Do not enable"],["\\>　　　効果の無効は、青鬼連続逃走回数を本格的に競うときなど、\n\\>　　　特別な場合のために用意されています。","","Disabling the effect is permitted to allow for particular use cases,\nsuch as competing to escape the oni the most times in a row."],["\\C[24]　　考え直す　　","","\\C[24]Are you sure?"],["本当に無効にする","","really disable"],["EV027","","EV027"]],"context":[["Map078/events/1/name"],["Map078/events/2/name"],["Map078/events/3/name"],["Map078/events/3/pages/0/list/11/comment"],["Map078/events/3/pages/0/list/24/comment"],["Map078/events/3/pages/1/list/0/comment","Map078/events/27/pages/1/list/0/comment"],["Map078/events/3/pages/1/list/10/comment","Map078/events/27/pages/1/list/10/comment","Map078/events/27/pages/2/list/5/comment"],["Map078/events/4/name"],["Map078/events/5/name"],["Map078/events/6/name"],["Map078/events/7/name"],["Map078/events/8/name"],["Map078/events/9/name"],["Map078/events/10/name"],["Map078/events/11/name"],["Map078/events/12/name"],["Map078/events/13/name"],["Map078/events/14/name"],["Map078/events/15/name"],["Map078/events/16/name"],["Map078/events/17/name"],["Map078/events/18/name"],["Map078/events/19/name"],["Map078/events/20/name"],["Map078/events/21/name"],