iece07","","DiscardCharacter !$piece07"],["DiscardCharacter !$piece08","","DiscardCharacter !$piece08"],["DiscardCharacter !$piece09","","DiscardCharacter !$piece09"],["DiscardCharacter !$piece10","","DiscardCharacter !$piece10"],["DiscardCharacter !$piece11","","DiscardCharacter !$piece11"],["DiscardCharacter !$piece12","","DiscardCharacter !$piece12"],["DiscardCharacter !$piece13","","DiscardCharacter !$piece13"],["DiscardCharacter !$piece14","","DiscardCharacter !$piece14"],["DiscardCharacter !$piece15","","DiscardCharacter !$piece15"],["DiscardCharacter !$piece16","","DiscardCharacter !$piece16"],["DiscardCharacter !$piece17","","DiscardCharacter !$piece17"],["DiscardCharacter !$piece18","","DiscardCharacter !$piece18"],["DiscardCharacter !$piece19","","DiscardCharacter !$piece19"],["DiscardCharacter !$piece20","","DiscardCharacter !$piece20"],["DiscardCharacter !$piece21","","DiscardCharacter !$piece21"],["EV003","","EV003"],["EV004","","EV004"],["青位置設定","","blue position setting"],["--------------------\n■デバッグモード","","--------------------\n■Debug mode"],["--------------------","","--------------------"],["EV006","","EV006"],["EV007","","EV007"],["\\n<\\N[2]>開かない","","\\n<\\N[2]>It won't open."],["開かない","","won't open"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>こっちは『青鬼』ＭＶ版の新要素……もとい、\n古きよきもの（旧バージョンの仕掛け）を\n再利用してるとこ。","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>This is a new element of the MV version of \"Ao Oni\"...\nGood old things (old version tricks)\nI'm reusing it."],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>それにしても、ツクールＭＶに移植中の\n『青鬼』のデータに潜れちゃうなんて、\n思えばすごいねえ？","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> Anyway, it's being ported to Maker MV.\nI can’t believe I can dive into the data of “Ao Oni”.\nIsn't it amazing when you think about it?"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>まだデータでしか見てないけど。\n『青鬼』の世界、広いねぇ～","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号> I've only seen the data yet.\nThe world of “Ao Oni” is so wide!"],["EV008","","EV008"],["\\n<\\N[2]>閉められない","","\\n<\\N[2]> Can't close"],["EV009","","EV009"],["青ルート補正","","blue route correction"],["DiscardPicture tetugousi","","DiscardPicture tetugousi"],["DiscardPicture te","","DiscardPicture te"],["DiscardPicture ao_up","","DiscardPicture ao_up"],["DiscardPicture ao_up_mika","","DiscardPicture ao_up_mika"],["DiscardPicture ao_up_takesi","","DiscardPicture ao_up_takesi"],["DiscardPicture ao_up_takurou","","DiscardPicture ao_up_takurou"],["金庫","","safe"],["\\n<\\N[2]>「紙切れ」と「タリスマンの書」を手に入れた","","\\n<\\N[2]>I found the items, \"Piece of Paper\",\nand, \"Book of Amulets\"."],["青２","","blue 2"],["フワッティーＣ","","Fuwatty C"],["\\n<\\N[2]>競走中すみません！\\!\n追ってくる化け物に廊下ドンして下さい！！","","\\n<\\N[2]>Sorry, I'm racing! \\!\nPlease don't run down the hallway to the monster chasing you! !"],["------------------------------\nこのモードで未使用の\n変数と金庫を活用\n------------------------------","","------------------------------\nUnused in this mode\nLeverage variables and safes\n------------------------------"],["\\n<\\N[2]>廊下で競走すると他の方と\n廊下ドンや辻ドンをしてしまいますよ？","","\\n<\\N[2]> When you race in the hallway, you will meet other people.\nDo you end up doing hallway don or tsuji don?"],["イモムシ鬼Ｃ","","Caterpillar Oni C"],["\\n<\\N[2]>競走中のところすみません、\n助けて下さい！","","\\n<\\N[2]>I'm sorry I'm in the middle of a race.\nPlease help!"],["\\n<\\N[2]>あなたはカメさん役ですか？","","\\n<\\N[2]>Are you the turtle?"],["\\n<\\N[2]>壁をすり抜けるとは！\\!\n忍者の方だったのですか。\\.\\.ありがとうございます！！","","\\n<\\N[2]>I can't believe I can pass through the wall! \\!\nWas it the ninja? \\.\\. Thank you! !"],["青トカゲＣ","","blue lizard C"],["\\n<\\N[2]>そうだ……！","","\\n<\\N[2]> That's right...!"],["---------------------------------------\nロボひろし、５系の青トカゲに乗って\nロボ青鬼をかわす。","","---------------------------------------\nRobo Hiroshi rides a 5 series blue lizard\nDodge the robot blue demon."],["---------------------------------------\nロボひろしが５系の青トカゲに乗る画像に変更","","---------------------------------------\nChanged the image of Robo Hiroshi riding a 5-series blue lizard."],["---------------------------------------\n青トカゲに乗って逃走\nルート上に青鬼がいれば回避\n（ループを使う処理は重いらしいのでラベルによる処理）","","---------------------------------------\nEscape on a blue lizard\nAvoid if there is a blue demon on the route\n(Processing using a loop seems to be heavy, so processing using labels)"],["-----------------------------\n逃走後、和室に移動\n-----------------------------","","-----------------------------\nAfter escaping, move to a Japanese-style room\n-----------------------------"],["---------------------------------------\n通常メッセージ","","---------------------------------------\nnormal message"],["\\n<\\N[2]>背中の目は、なんのために\n用いているのでしょうか……？","","\\n<\\N[2]>What are the eyes on your back for?\nAre you using it...?"],["EV016","","EV016"],["画像読込み用イベント","","Image loading event"],["EV017","","EV017"],["\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>本編だと、ここに金庫があるところ。\\!\n金庫ごと消えちゃ聴診器も役に立たないよ……","","\\n<\\I[\\V[86]] \\C[24]４号>In the main story, this is where the safe is. \\!\nIf the safe disappears, even a stethoscope will be useless..."]],"context":[["Map080/events/1/name"],["Map080/events/2/name"],["Map080/events/2/pages/0/list/0/Plugin Command","Map080/events/3/pages/0/list/0/Plugin Command","Map080/events/4/pages/0/list/0/Plugin Command"],["Map080/events/2/pages/0/list/1/Plugin Command","Map080/events/3/pages/0/list/1/Plugin Command","Map080/events/4/pages/0/list/1/Plugin Command"],["Map080/events/2/pages/0/list/2/Plugin Command","Map080/events/3/pages/0/list/2/Plugin Command","Map080/events/4/pages/0/list/2/Plugin Command"],["Map080/events/2/pages/0/list/3/Plugin Command","Map080/events/3/pages/0/list/3/Plugin Command","Map080/events/4/pages/0/list/3/Plugin Command"],["Map080/events/2/pages/0/list/4/Plugin Command","Map080/events/3/pages/0/list/4/Plugin Command","Map080/events/4/pages/0/list/4/Plugin Command"],["Map080/events/2/pages/0/list/5/Plugin Command","Map080/events/3/pages/0/list/5/Plugin Command","Map080/events/4/pages/0/list/5/Plugin Command"],["Map080/events/2/pages/0/list/6/Plugin Command","Map080/events/3/pages/0/list/6/Plugin Command","Map080/events/4/pages/0/list/6/Plugin Command"],["Ma