takuki_washing 0 0","","AltBgs play sdky_sentakuki_washing 0 0"],["-----------------------------------\n洗濯機開いているときは\n閉めておく","","-----------------------------------\nWhen the washing machine is open\nkeep it closed"],["---------------------------------------------\n珠緒の洗濯機の中にいる幻影\n（水注ぐ音も先読み）","","---------------------------------------------\nThe illusion inside Tamao's washing machine\n(Also read the sound of water pouring in advance)"],["\\n<珠緒>また行き止まり……。\\!\n経蔵の気配はときどき感じるけど、\n感覚が狂ってたどり着けない……。","","\\n<珠緒> Another dead end... \\!\nI sometimes feel the presence of sutras,\nMy senses go crazy and I can't reach it..."],["\\n<珠緒>背中の気配がいきなり経蔵から伽椰子のに変わって\n逃げてきてから……\\!どのぐらいたつんだろう……。","","\\n<珠緒>The presence on my back suddenly changed from Kyozo to Kayako.\nSince I ran away...\\!I wonder how long..."],["\\n<珠緒>なんだか井戸の底で\nうろうろと迷ってるみたい……。","","\\n<珠緒>Somehow at the bottom of the well\nIt seems like I'm wandering around and getting lost..."],["\\n<珠緒>！？  \\.\\.頭に景色が流れ込んでくる……？","","\\n<珠緒>! ?  \\.\\.The scenery flows into my head...?"],["\\n<珠緒>上から誰か見おろしてる……？","","\\n<珠緒> Is someone looking down from above...?"],["---------------------------------------\n洗濯槽回転","","---------------------------------------\nwashing tub rotation"],["RotatePictureEx 16 265 25 1","","RotatePictureEx 16 265 25 1"],["RotatePictureEx 16 30 15 1","","RotatePictureEx 16 30 15 1"],["RotatePictureEx 16 -270 25 1","","RotatePictureEx 16 -270 25 1"],["RotatePictureEx 16 -25 15 1","","RotatePictureEx 16 -25 15 1"],["RotatePictureEx 16 275 25 1","","RotatePictureEx 16 275 25 1"],["RotatePictureEx 16 -265 25 1","","RotatePictureEx 16 -265 25 1"],["RotatePictureEx 16 270 25 1","","RotatePictureEx 16 270 25 1"],["RotatePictureEx 16 -275 25 1","","RotatePictureEx 16 -275 25 1"],["\\n<珠緒>床が回ってる！？","","\\n<珠緒> The floor is spinning! ?"],["\\n<珠緒>み、\\.\\.水が！！","","\\n<珠緒> Look, \\.\\. Water! !"],["-----------------------------------------------\n貞子が立っている。","","-----------------------------------------------\nSadako is standing."],["\\n<珠緒>がぼ、\\.\\.ぐぶ\\.…\\.…\\.！\\.！","","\\n<珠緒> Gabo, \\.\\. Gubu \\.…\\.…\\.! \\.!"],["\\n<経蔵>かすかに水の音……。\\!\\C[1]洗濯機\\C[0]か。\\!\n\\N[2]、お前の予想はビンゴだったかもな！？","","\\n<経蔵> The faint sound of water... \\!\\C[1] Washing machine \\C[0]? \\!\n\\N[2], your guess might have been bingo! ?"],["自由行動でここに来た時","","When I came here on my free time"],["AltBgs vol 0 90 1","","AltBgs vol 0 90 1"],["------------------------------------\n珠緒が放心状態になっていた。","","------------------------------------\nTamao was in a daze."],["\\n<経蔵>珠緒！！","","\\n<経蔵> Tamao! !"],["\\n<経蔵>お前が……\\.\\.やったのか\\.…\\.…\\.！\\.！","","\\n<経蔵> You...\\.\\. Did you do it? \\....\\....\\.! \\.!"],["AltBgs fadeOut 0 3","","AltBgs fadeOut 0 3"],["珠緒さんを和室で介抱することになった。","","I decided to take care of Tamao in a Japanese-style room."],["俊雄","","Toshio"],["洗濯機EV","","washing machine EV"],["------------------------------\nフタ開閉","","------------------------------\nLid opening/closing"],["\\n<経蔵>そういえば昔のマンガで、\n炊飯器に魔王を封じたシーンがあったっけな。\\!\nなんだったか……","","\\n<経蔵>Now that I think about it, it's an old manga.\nI think there was a scene where the demon lord was sealed in a rice cooker. \\!\nI wonder what it was..."],["\\n<経蔵>貞子を同じように、この洗濯機に\n封じたいもんだぜ。","","\\n<経蔵> Sadako in this washing machine in the same way\nI want to seal it away."],["洗濯機グラ","","washing machine gra"],["貞子","","Sadako"],["水たまり","","puddle"]],"context":[["Map097/events/1/name"],["Map097/events/2/name"],["Map097/events/2/pages/0/list/2/comment","Map097/events/3/pages/0/list/2/comment"],["Map097/events/2/pages/0/list/7/comment","Map097/events/3/pages/0/list/7/comment"],["Map097/events/2/pages/0/list/12/comment","Map097/events/3/pages/0/list/12/comment"],["Map097/events/2/pages/0/list/18/Plugin Command","Map097/events/3/pages/0/list/18/Plugin Command"],["Map097/events/2/pages/0/list/37/message/hasPicture/top","Map097/events/3/pages/0/list/37/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map097/events/2/pages/0/list/45/comment","Map097/events/2/pages/0/list/63/comment","Map097/event