son","dataType":"map","filename":"Map097","basename":"Map097.json","path":"data/Map097.json","relPath":"data/Map097.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":true,"progress":{"translated":54,"length":54,"percent":100},"cellInfo":[]},"data/Map098.json":{"data":[["EV001","","EV001"],["EV002","","EV002"],["青","","blue"],["青位置設定","","blue position setting"],["--------------------\n■デバッグモード","","--------------------\n■Debug mode"],["--------------------","","--------------------"],["洗濯機グラ","","washing machine gra"],["洗濯機ＥＶ","","washing machine EV"],["------------------------------\nドア開閉","","------------------------------\ndoor opening/closing"],["--------------------------------------\n経蔵がいるとき","","--------------------------------------\nWhen there is a sutra"],["\\n<経蔵>……伽椰子の気配がドラムの中に残ってるな。\\!\nったく、どこから狙ってんだよ。","","\\n<経蔵>... Kayako's presence remains in the drum. \\!\nWhere in the world are you aiming from?"],["\\n<珠緒>あたしなら正面を避けて\n洗濯機のスイッチを入れるね。","","\\n<珠緒>If it were me, I would avoid the front.\nI'll turn on the washing machine."],["\\n<珠緒>貞子も投げ込んで\n\\C[8]「たっぷり」\\C[0]すすいでやりたい。","","\\n<珠緒> Throw in Sadako too.\n\\C[8] \"A lot\" \\C[0] I want to rinse it out."],["\\n<経蔵>ふっ。\\.\\.正面を避けて\nどうやって投げ込むんだよ。","","\\n<経蔵> Huh. \\.\\. Avoid the front\nHow do I throw it in?"],["\\n<\\N[2]>化け物はドラム式洗濯機の\n「閉じ込み事故」とは無縁のようですね……。","","\\n<\\N[2]> The monster is a drum-type washing machine.\nIt seems like this has nothing to do with a \"trapment accident\"..."],["-------------------------------------\n無敵で難を逃れたとき。\nひろし１人だと伽椰子がついてくる","","-------------------------------------\nWhen you are invincible and escape from trouble.\nIf Hiroshi is alone, Kayako will come with him."],["--------------------------------------------\nひろし１人だと伽椰子に襲われる","","--------------------------------------------\nIf Hiroshi is alone, Kayako will attack him."],["\\n<\\N[2]>洗濯機から人の気配が……？？","","\\n<\\N[2]> There is a sign of someone coming from the washing machine...? ?"],["EV007","","EV007"],["AltBgs vol 0 15 1","","AltBgs vol 0 15 1"]],"context":[["Map098/events/1/name"],["Map098/events/2/name"],["Map098/events/3/name"],["Map098/events/4/name"],["Map098/events/4/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map098/events/4/pages/0/list/7/comment"],["Map098/events/5/name"],["Map098/events/6/name"],["Map098/events/6/pages/0/list/2/comment"],["Map098/events/6/pages/0/list/18/comment"],["Map098/events/6/pages/0/list/21/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map098/events/6/pages/0/list/25/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map098/events/6/pages/0/list/29/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map098/events/6/pages/0/list/32/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map098/events/6/pages/0/list/40/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map098/events/6/pages/0/list/50/comment"],["Map098/events/6/pages/0/list/75/comment"],["Map098/events/6/pages/0/list/106/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map098/events/7/name"],["Map098/events/7/pages/0/list/1/Plugin Command"]],"tags":[null,null,null,null,["blue"],["blue"],null,null,["blue"],["blue"],null,null,null,null,null,["blue"],["blue"],null,null,["red"]],"parameters":[null,null,null,null,[{"headerIndex":0,"headerParam":["--------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":7,"headerParam":["--------------------"]}],null,null,[{"headerIndex":2,"headerParam":["------------------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":18,"headerParam":["--------------------------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":21,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":25,"headerParam":["spiritualists",1,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":29,"headerParam":["spiritualists",1,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":32,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":40,"headerParam":["N2",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":50,"headerParam":["-------------------------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":75,"headerParam":["--------------------------------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":106,"headerParam":["N2",0,0,0]}]],"indexIds":{"EV001":0,"EV002":1,"青":2,"青位置設定":3,"--------------------\n■デバッグモード":4,"--------------------":5,"洗濯機グラ":6,"