nsion":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map100","basename":"Map100.json","path":"data/Map100.json","relPath":"data/Map100.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":true,"progress":{"translated":12,"length":12,"percent":100},"cellInfo":[]},"data/Map101.json":{"data":[["EV001","","EV001"],["-----------------------------------\nトラップフワッティーの位置が\n左寄りであれば、なんらかの形で\nよけて生存した、と判断する","","-----------------------------------\nThe location of the trap fluffy is\nIf you are on the left, in some way\nDecide that you survived by dodging"],["青","","blue"],["青位置設定","","blue position setting"],["--------------------\n■デバッグモード","","--------------------\n■Debug mode"],["--------------------","","--------------------"],["トラップ俊雄","","Trap Toshio"],["トラップフワッティー","","Trap Fuwatty"],["\\n<\\N[2]>まさかドアに化けていたとは……。\\.\\.\n経蔵さん、助かりました！\\!\nとっさに肩を引いて下さいまして……","","\\n<\\N[2]> I never expected it to turn into a door... \\.\\.\nKeizo-san, thank you for your help! \\!\nPlease pull your shoulders immediately..."],["\\n<経蔵>バケモンに意表突かれんな。\nバケモンの意表を突くぐらいでいろ！\\!\n……ったく！","","\\n<経蔵> Don't let the monster catch you by surprise.\nJust try to surprise the monster! \\!\n...Taku!"],["\\n<経蔵>おっと、\\.\\.バケモンがドアと合体して\n化けてやがったか！","","\\n<経蔵> Oops, \\.\\. The monster merges with the door.\nHave you turned into a monster?"],["----------------------------------------\nひろし一人の場合","","----------------------------------------\nIn the case of Hiroshi alone"],["\\n<\\N[2]>まさか化け物がドアに化けていたとは……！","","\\n<\\N[2]> I never expected a monster to turn into a door...!"],["記事","","article"],["\n何かの記事がある。\\!\n大喜利の特集のようだ。","","\nThere's an article about something. \\!\nIt seems to be a special feature on Ogiri."],["お題：\n『リオの閉会式にアベマリオとともにルイージ貞子が登場！\n　何をした？』","","Subject:\n“Luigi Sadako appears with Abe Mario at Rio’s closing ceremony!\nWhat did you do? ”"],["答え：\n『アベサダとしてアブないキノコ狩りを満喫した』","","Answer:\n``I thoroughly enjoyed hunting mushrooms without danger as Abesada.''"]],"context":[["Map101/events/1/name"],["Map101/events/1/pages/0/list/2/comment"],["Map101/events/2/name"],["Map101/events/3/name"],["Map101/events/3/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map101/events/3/pages/0/list/7/comment"],["Map101/events/4/name"],["Map101/events/5/name"],["Map101/events/5/pages/0/list/14/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map101/events/5/pages/0/list/18/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map101/events/5/pages/0/list/24/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map101/events/5/pages/0/list/33/comment"],["Map101/events/5/pages/0/list/48/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map101/events/6/name"],["Map101/events/6/pages/0/list/1/message/noPicture/top"],["Map101/events/6/pages/0/list/5/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map101/events/6/pages/0/list/9/message/noPicture/middle"]],"tags":[null,["blue"],null,null,["blue"],["blue"],null,null,null,null,null,["blue"]],"parameters":[null,[{"headerIndex":2,"headerParam":["-----------------------------------"]}],null,null,[{"headerIndex":0,"headerParam":["--------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":7,"headerParam":["--------------------"]}],null,null,[{"headerIndex":14,"headerParam":["N2",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":18,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":24,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":33,"headerParam":["----------------------------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":48,"headerParam":["N2",0,0,2]}],null,[{"headerIndex":1,"headerParam":["",0,1,0]}],[{"headerIndex":5,"headerParam":["",0,1,1]}],[{"headerIndex":9,"headerParam":["",0,1,1]}]],"indexIds":{"EV001":0,"-----------------------------------\nトラップフワッティーの位置が\n左寄りであれば、なんらかの形で\nよけて生存した、と判断する":1,"青":2,"青位置設定":3,"--------------------\n■デバッグモード":4,"--------------------":5,"トラップ俊雄":6,"トラップフワッティー":7,"\\n<\\N[2]>まさかドアに化けていたとは……。\\.\\.\n経蔵さん、助かりました！\\!\nとっさに肩を引いて下さいまして……":8,"\\n<経蔵>バケモンに意表突かれんな。\nバケモンの意表を突くぐらいでいろ！\\!\n……ったく！":9,"\\n<経蔵>おっと、\\.\\.バケモンがドアと合体して\n化けてやがったか！":10,"----------------------------------------\nひろし一人の場合":11,"\\n<\\N[2]>まさか化け物がドアに化けていたとは……！":12,"記事":13,"\n何かの記事がある。\\!\n大喜利の特集のようだ。":14,"お題：\n『リオの閉会式にアベマリオとともにルイージ貞子が登場！\n　何をした？』":15,"答え：\n『アベサダとしてアブないキノコ狩りを満喫した』":16},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map101","basename":"Map101.json","path":"data/Map101.json","relPath":"data/Map101.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":true,"progress":{"translated":17,"length":17,"percent":100},"cellInfo":[]},"data/Map102.json":{"data":[["EV001","","EV001"],["\\n<\\N[2]>ビデオデッキを持ってこないと……","","\\n<\\N[2]> I need to bring a video deck..."],["EV002","","EV002"],["青","","blue"],["青位置設定","","blue position setting"],["--------------------\n■デバッグモード","","--------------------\n■Debug mode"],["--------------------","","--------------------"],["テレビ（イベント）","","TV (event)"],["\\n<経蔵>……俺が用意したテレビとビデオデッキだ。\\!\nご丁寧に配線まで整えてやがる。","","\\n<経蔵>...This is the TV and VCR that I prepared. \\!\nWe will carefully arrange the wiring."],["\\n<\\N[2]>以前見かけた機種よりは新しそうでしたので、\nなぜかとは思っていました。\\!\n化け物でもテレビを買い替えたいと考えるのでしょうか。","","\\n<\\N[2]>It seemed newer than the models I had seen before, so\nI was wondering why. \\!\nDo you want to replace your TV even if it's a monster?"],["\\n<経蔵>さあな。\\.\\.俺はテレビを持つ。\\.\\.\n珠緒、\\.\\.リモコンぐらいは持てるな？","","\\n<経蔵> Come on. \\.\\.I have a TV. \\.\\.\nTamao, can you carry at least the \\.\\. remote control?"],["\\n<珠緒>盲人使いが荒いんだから。\\!\n……テレビを盗んだ犯人は、\n確かにこの屋敷の化け物かもね。","","\\n<珠緒>The blind man is rough. \\!\n...The culprit who stole the TV...\nIt may indeed be a monster in this mansion."],["\\n<珠緒>このリモコンにも\nそれらしい気配が少し残ってる。","","\\n<珠緒>This remote control also\nThere's still some hint of that."],["\\n<経蔵>\\N[2]、ビデオデッキをたのむ。","","\\n<経蔵>\\N[2], ask for a VCR."],["\\n<\\N[2]>座敷牢は\\C[1]玄関ロビーから↑、→の\n突き当たりの部屋の中の、本棚の裏\\C[0]ですよ。","","\\n<\\N[2]> Zashiki is \\C[1] ↑, → from the entrance lobby.\nIt's \\C[0] behind the bookshelf in the room at the end."],["\\n<経蔵>さっき見せてもらったから分かるっての！\\.\\.\nったく、とんだ隠し部屋だったな？","","\\n<経蔵>I understand because you showed it to me earlier! \\.\\.\nIt was a really hidden room, wasn't it?"],["\\n<珠緒>さっさと来ないと死ぬよ？","","\\n<珠緒> If you don't come quickly, you'll die?"],["ビデオデッキを手に入れた。\\!\nテスト再生用のビデオテープも適当なものを\nここから持ち出すことにした。","","I got a VCR. \\!\nUse a suitable videotape for test playback.\nI decided to take it from here."],["\\n<\\N[2]>テープの挿入口に何か引っかかっていますね。\\!\n……髪？","","\\n<\\N[2]> Something is caught in the tape insertion slot. \\!\n...Hair?"],["\\n<\\N[2]>それと、このノートは……？","","\\n<\\N[2]>And this notebook...?"],["\\n<\\N[2]>日記のようですが、なぜデッキの上に……","","\\n<\\N[2]>It looks like a diary, but why is it on the deck..."],["イベント：マー","","Event: Mar"],["イベント：経蔵","","Event: Kyozo"],["イベント：珠緒","","Event: Tamao"],["イベント：貞子","","Event: Sadako"],["イベント：伽椰子","","Event: Kayako"],["テレビ（グラ）","","TV (gra)"],["レンジのイベント","","range events"],["-----------------------------------------\nこのイベントは珠緒がさらわれるまで有効","","-----------------------------------------\nThis event is valid until Tamao is kidnapped."],["\\n<\\N[2]>経蔵さん、レンジが何か？","","\\n<\\N[2]> Mr. Keizo, what is the microwave?"],["\\n<経蔵>俊雄のオヤジ（佐伯剛雄）が、\n女房の伽椰子と息子の俊雄を殺した後……","","\\n<経蔵> Toshio's father (Takeo Saeki)\nAfter killing his wife Kayako and son Toshio..."],["\\n<経蔵>俊雄がかわいがっていた猫（マー）まで\nレンジに入れて殺した、\\.\\.って話はしたっけか。","","\\n<経蔵> Toshio's pet cat (Ma)\nDid I mention \\.\\., which I killed by putting it in the microwave?"],["\\n<経蔵>その顛末がネットでイジられていたのを\n思い出してな。","","\\n<経蔵>The whole story was teased on the internet.\nRemember that."],["\\n<珠緒>『佐伯剛雄は腹いせにレンジで\nマーからマー油をこしらえようとした』って、\\.\\.あれ？","","\\n<珠緒> “Takeo Saeki is angry at the microwave.\n\"I tried to make mer oil from mer\", \\.\\.?"],["\\n<珠緒>好きだよね～\\.\\.経蔵。\\.\\.\nその手のブラックジョーク。","","\\n<珠緒>I love you~\\.\\.Kyozo. \\.\\.\nThat kind of black joke."],["\\n<経蔵>だからといって、\nマーをからかう気はないけどな。","","Just because it's \\n<経蔵>,\nI don't mean to make fun of Ma though."],["\\n<珠緒>ウワサをすれば。","","\\n<珠緒>If there are rumors."],["\\n<経蔵>よう。\\.\\.悪かったな、話題にして。\\!\n最初に振ったのはこいつ（\\N[2]）だから\n先に引っ掻いてやれ。","","\\n<経蔵>. \\.\\. That was bad, bring it up. \\!\nThis is the one who shook it first (\\N[2])\nScratch it first."],["\\n<\\N[2]>！！？？","","\\n<\\N[2]>! ! ? ?"],["\\n<経蔵>俊雄によろしくな。","","\\n<経蔵> Please say hello to Toshio."],["------------------------------\n経蔵がいないときは\n背後の棚から映画のように伽椰子に襲われる","","------------------------------\nWhen there is no sutra\nKayako is attacked from the shelf behind you like in the movie."],["\\n<\\N[2]>足元に人の気配が……？？","","\\n<\\N[2]> Is there a sign of someone at my feet...? ?"],["------------------------------\n伽椰子をしのいだあと","","------------------------------\nAfter passing through Kayako"],["\\n<\\N[2]>これまでと違う襲い方をする\n化け物がいるようですね……","","\\n<\\N[2]> Attack in a different way than before\nLooks like there's a monster..."],["せまる伽椰子の手","","Semaru Kayako's hand"],["冷蔵庫","","refrigerator"],["冷蔵庫ＥＶ","","Refrigerator EV"],["\\n<経蔵>飲めそうなモンが入っていたら、\n逆に警戒すべきだろうな。","","\\n<経蔵>If there is something you can drink,\nOn the contrary, you should be careful."],["\\n<珠緒>その割に飲みたそうだね？","","\\n<珠緒>It seems like you drank a lot for that amount, right?"],["\\n<経蔵>生きて帰れたときのお楽しみ、\\.\\.だな。","","\\n<経蔵>It's fun when you get home alive, \\.\\.."],["--------------------------------------------\nひろし１人だと伽椰子に襲われる","","--------------------------------------------\nIf Hiroshi is alone, Kayako will attack him."],["-------------------------------------\n無敵で難を逃れたとき","","-------------------------------------\nWhen you are invincible and escape from trouble"],["\\n<\\N[2]>冷蔵庫から人の気配が……？？","","\\n<\\N[2]> Is there a sign of someone coming from the refrigerator...? ?"],["EV016","","EV016"],["<high>","","<high>"],["EV017","","EV017"],["EV018","","EV018"],["EV019","","EV019"]],"context":[["Map102/events/1/name"],["Map102/events/1/pages/0/list/6/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map102/events/2/name"],["Map102/events/3/name"],["Map102/events/4/name"],["Map102/events/4/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map102/events/4/pages/0/list/7/comment"],["Map102/events/5/name"],["Map102/events/5/pages/1/list/8/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map102/events/5/pages/1/list/11/mess