…！？":30,"\\n<経蔵>……なるほど。たしかにこの上はヤバそうだ。\\!\nおい\\N[2]。いまこの上に行くのはやめとけ。\nお友達からのご忠告だ。":31,"\\n<珠緒>たしかにね。この上は……":32,"\\n<\\N[2]>……？":33,"\\n<\\N[2]>気持ちが確かにそこに“いる”としても、\n本人の実体がないと戸惑うものですね……。\\!\n卓郎、わかりました。\\.\\.いま上に行くのは控えておきます。":34,"\\n<\\N[2]>なぜかは分かりませんが、\n先に進む気をそがれますね……？":35,"-------------------------------\nセルフＡ：卓郎の魂と会話済み":36,"\\n<経蔵>……何を散歩してるんだ、俺は。\\!\n身体の方が先にヤキがまわったか……？":37,"たけしの魂":38,"\\n<珠緒>なにコイツ、もう死んでるのにビビってる。":39,"\\n<経蔵>ははっ。死んだって怖いもんは怖いだろ。\n友達のために逃げずに番をしてるだけ、\nエラいと思ってやれよ。":40,"\\n<経蔵>ここでバケモンにやられた\nお前の友達だ。\\.\\.“たけし”、\\.\\.だそうだ。":41,"\\n<\\N[2]>……！！":42,"\\n<経蔵>悪いことは言わない。\nこの上を確かめるのは後にしておこうな。":43,"-----------------------------------------\nひろし１人のとき":44,"\\n<\\N[2]>たけし、実感が不十分で申し訳ないですが\nお気遣い、ありがとうございます。\\!\nいま、この上に行くのは控えておきます。":45,"\\n<\\N[2]>（故人に語りかけやすいように、\n仏壇や遺影が必要なのですね。\\!\nようやく理解できました……）":46,"ミッション１・４鬼ＥＶ":47,"-----------------------------\n●画像の準備":48,"-----------------------------":49,"\\n<\\N[2]>玄関のドアは、\\C[1]化け物から逃れてから\\C[0]\n調べましょう！":50,"-----------------------------\n青ID->青出現->進行値":51,"---------------------------------------------":52,"\\^":53,"体勢を整える（セーブ）":54,"すぐ逃げる":55,"\\n<珠緒>…………\\.\\.来る！！":56,"-------------------------------------\n青ID->青出現->進行値":57,"AooniMoveSet 5 0 10":58,"--------------------------------":59,"俊雄と階段イベント":60,"--------------------------------------------\n表（オープニング）から引き継ぎ":61,"\\n<経蔵>お前ら、よくがんばった！\nもうどっかに隠れてろ！":62,"\\n<経蔵>俊雄なら捕まえられると思ったが、\nあの様子じゃ厳しいな。\\!まずは上を探しに行くぞ。":63,"洗濯機・電話音":64,"AltBgs vol 0 0 1":65,"AltBgs vol 0 0 0":66,"自動イベント":67,"\\n<\\N[2]>経蔵さん、出口である玄関は開けられるのですか？\\!\n最強とおぼしき化け物が強固なロックを\nかけているかも……":68,"\\n<経蔵>霊力をカギのある一点に集中させる。全力で。":69,"\\n<経蔵>その瞬間に珠緒、ノブを回せ。\\!\n\\N[2]はノブが回った瞬間、ドアに体当たりだ。":70,"\\n<経蔵>和室のときに、この発想がなくて悪かった。\\!\nぶっつけ本番だが、頼むぞ！！":71,"AooniKayakoHouseProcess X":72,"EV024":73,"フワ俊雄現る":74,"StandTo フワ俊雄 p 5 ":75,"\\n<\\N[2]>猫の耳に見えるものは\n四角い化け物に由来するコブのようですね。":76,"\\n<経蔵>コブができたのはこっちだぜ！？":77,"\\n<珠緒>解説うざい。":78,"---------------------------------------------\nピクチャ準備":79,"----------------------------------------\n青ID->青出現->進行値":80,"AooniMoveSet 3 4 青":81,"SetStandBy フワ俊雄 reach reach 2+":82,"AltBgs stop 0":83,"フワッティー":84,"フワ俊雄":85},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map104","basename":"Map104.json","path":"data/Map104.json","relPath":"data/Map104.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":true,"progress":{"translated":86,"length":86,"percent":100},"cellInfo":[]},"data/Map105.json":{"data":[["EV001","","EV001"],["青","","blue"],["青位置設定","","blue position setting"],["--------------------\n■デバッグモード","","--------------------\n■Debug mode"],["--------------------","","--------------------"],["青鬼のモデル","","blue demon model"],["　　　　引き出しの中に子供のものらしい絵があった。\\!\n　　　　その絵の人物は青鬼の顔と面影が似ている。\\!\n　　　　“パパ”","","There was a drawing in the drawer that looked like it belonged to a child. \\!\n　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　“ \\!\n　　　　“Daddy”"],["\\n<\\N[2]>“パパ”とされる人物は、\n青鬼とどのような関係があるのでしょうか……？","","\\n<\\N[2]>The person who is said to be “Papa” is\nWhat kind of relationship does it have with Ao Oni...?"],["\\n<経蔵>“パパ”となれば屋敷の主人だろうな。\\!\nさっきテスト用のビデオでちらっと見かけた（座敷牢で）\n本人らしいやつの方が人間らしい顔してたな。","","\\n<経蔵> If he were to be a \"dad\", he would probably be the owner of the mansion. \\!\nI just saw a glimpse of it in the test video (in the prison)\nThe one who looked like himself had a more human-like face."],["\\n<珠緒>青鬼、気配がでたらめの部分が多いから……。","","\\n<珠緒> Ao Oni, there are a lot of random signs..."],["\\n<珠緒>“パパ”本人が青鬼なのか、\n“パパ”の姿を青鬼が取り入れてるのか。\\!\nまだ分からない……。","","\\n<珠緒> Is “Papa” himself a blue demon?\nIs Ao Oni adopting the appearance of “Papa”? \\!\nI don't know yet...."],["-----------------------------------\n青鬼命名前","","-----------------------------------\nAoki life name"],["　　　　引き出しの中に子供のものらしい絵があった。\\!\n　　　　その絵の人物は、屋敷の化け物の顔と面影が似ている。\\!\n　　　　“パパ”","","There was a drawing in the drawer that looked like it belonged to a child. \\!\nThe person in the picture resembles the face of the monster in the mansion. \\!\n　　　　“Daddy”"],["\\n<\\N[2]>“パパ”とされる人物は、\n屋敷の化け物とどのような関係があるのでしょうか……？","","\\n<\\N[2]>The person who is said to be “Papa” is\nWhat kind of relationship does it have with the monsters in the mansion?"],["\\n<経蔵>ここのバケモンの顔は、\nここの主人に似ている、ってことか。","","\\n<経蔵>The face of this monster is\nDoes that mean he looks like the owner here?"],["\\n<珠緒>犬が飼い主に似てくるのと同じかな？","","\\n<珠緒> Is it similar to how dogs start to resemble their owners?"],["俊雄","","Toshio"],["---------------------------------\n出現条件は、\nマーの治療＋珠緒の無事が確認できて以降","","---------------------------------\nThe appearance conditions are\nAfter Ma's treatment and Tamao's safety confirmed"],["\\n<経蔵>よう。ちょうどいいところにいたな。\\!\nそこでいい、動くなよ……？","","\\n<経蔵>. You were in the right place. \\!\nThat's fine, don't move...?"],["\\n<経蔵>何はともあれ珠緒が無事だったから、\nマーに続いてお前も治療することに決めた。","","\\n<経蔵> No matter what, Tamao was safe.\nI decided to treat you as well, following Ma."],["\\n<経蔵>効いているなら、お前の親父から受けた\n暴力の思い出……ケガの痛みに関しては単なる過去の記憶、\nという感じになっているだろう。","","\\n<経蔵>If it's working, you got it from your father.\nMemories of violence...The pain of injury is just a memory of the past.\nIt will probably look something like this."],["\\n<経蔵>俺だって驚いているんだ。\nまさか自分がお前らの治療をしようなんて発想を\n持とうなんてな。","","\\n<経蔵> Even I was surprised.\nI never thought I would be the one to treat you.\nI don't want to have it."],["\\n<経蔵>マーに感謝しな。\\!\n生前ひどいめに遭って恨みは抱いていたものの、\n俺の知る限り、マーは誰かに直接危害を加えたことはない。","","\\n<経蔵>Thank you Mar. \\!\nAlthough he had suffered a lot of misfortune during his life and held a grudge against him,\nAs far as I know, Ma has never directly harmed anyone."],["\\n<経蔵>それで情けをかける気になれたってワケだ。","","\\n<経蔵> That's why I felt like showing mercy."],["\\n<経蔵>ま、飼い主のお前がいつも代わりに\n呪ってくれてたから、かもしれねえが。","","\\n<経蔵> Well, you, the owner, always take my place.\nMaybe it was because he cursed me."],["\\n<経蔵>伽椰子に伝えてくれ。\nおとなしく出てきてくれたら治療してやる、\\.\\.ってな。","","\\n<経蔵> Tell Kayako.\nIf you come out quietly, I'll treat you, \\.\\.."],["\\n<経蔵>抱えている身体の苦しみを取り去れば、\n呪う気持ちの一角を崩せる。\\!\n……さっき気づいたばかりだが。","","\\n<経蔵>If you remove the physical pain that you are carrying,\nYou can break the corner of your curse. \\!\n...I just noticed it a while ago."],["\\n<経蔵>情けも使いよう、\\.\\.かもな。\\!\n……呪いの連鎖と拡散を確実に止めるために。","","\\n<経蔵>Let's have mercy, maybe \\.\\.. \\!\n...To definitely stop the chain and spread of the curse."],["\\n<珠緒>……情け２割、作戦８割、ってとこ？","","\\n<珠緒>...20% compassion, 80% strategy?"],["\\n<経蔵>正確だな。\\!\nその２割も８割も、ついさっきまでなかった。\\!\nこれで結果が出るなら、ネコの力は偉大、\\.\\.だな。","","\\n<経蔵>That's accurate. \\!\nNeither 20% nor 80% of that was there until recently. \\!\nIf this results in results, the power of cats is great, \\.\\.."],["--------------------------------------------","","--------------------------------------------"],["マー","","Mar"],["ラスト消灯","","Last lights out"]],"context":[["Map105/events/1/name"],["Map105/events/2/name"],["Map105/events/3/name"],["Map105/events/3/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map105/events/3/pages/0/list/7/comment"],["Map105/events/4/name"],["Map105/events/4/pages/0/list/2/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map105/events/4/pages/0/list/7/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map105/events/4/pages/0/list/13/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map105/events/4/pages/0/list/20/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map105/events/4/pages/0/list/22/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map105/events/4/pages/0/list/30/comment"],["Map105/events/4/pages/0/list/32/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map105/events/4/pages/0/list/37/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map105/events/4/pages/0/list/43/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map105/events/4/pages/0/list/49/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map105/events/5/name"],["Map105/events/5/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map105/events/5/pages/0/list/15/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map105/events/5/pages/0/list/33/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map105/events/5/pages/0/list/36/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map105/events/5/pages/0/list/45/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map105/events/5/pages/0/list/49/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map105/events/5/pages/0/list/53/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map105/events/5/pages/0/list/56/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map105/events/5/pages/0/list/59/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map105/events/5/pages/0/list/67/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map105/events/5/pages/0/list/73/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map105/events/5/pages/0/list/77/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map105/events/5/pages/0/list/79/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map105/events/5/pages/0/list/85/comment"],["Map105/events/6/name"],["Map105/events/7/name"]],"tags":[null,null,null,["blue"],["blue"],null,null,null,null,null,null,["blue"],null,null,null,null,null,["blue"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["blue"]],"parameters":[null,null,null,[{"headerIndex":0,"headerParam":["--------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":7,"headerParam":["--------------------"]}],null,[{"headerIndex":2,"headerParam":["",0,1,2]}],[{"headerIndex":7,"headerParam":["N2",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":13,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":20,"headerParam":["spiritualists",1,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":22,"headerParam":["spiritualists",1,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":30,"headerParam":["-----------------------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":32,"headerParam":["",0,1,2]}],[{"headerIndex":37,"headerParam":["N2",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":43,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":49,"headerParam":["spiritualists",1,0,2]}],null,[{"headerIndex":0,"headerParam":["---------------------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":15,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":33,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":36,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":45,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":49,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":53,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":56,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":59,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":67,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":73,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":77,"headerParam":["spiritualists",1,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":79,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":85,"headerParam":["--------------------------------------------"]}]],"indexIds":{"EV001":0,"青":1,"青位置設定":2,"--------------------\n■デバッグモード":3,"--------------------":4,"青鬼のモデル":5,"　　　　引き出しの中に子供のものらしい絵があった。\\!\n　　　　その絵の人物は青鬼の顔と面影が似ている。\\!\n　　　　“パパ”":6,"\\n<\\N[2]>“パパ”とされる人物は、\n青鬼とどのような関係があるのでしょうか……？":7,"\\n<経蔵>“パパ”となれば屋敷の主人だろうな。\\!\nさっきテスト用のビデオでちらっと見かけた（座敷牢で）\n本人らしいやつの方が人間らしい顔してたな。":8,"\\n<珠緒>青鬼、気配がでたらめの部分が多いから……。":9,"\\n<珠緒>“パパ”本人が青鬼なのか、\n“パパ”の姿を青鬼が取り入れてるのか。\\!\nまだ分からない……。":10,"-----------------------------------\n青鬼命名前":11,"　　　　引き出しの中に子供のものらしい絵があった。\\!\n　　　　その絵の人物は、屋敷の化け物の顔と面影が似ている。\\!\n　　　　“パパ”":12,"\\n<\\N[2]>“パパ”とされる人物は、\n屋敷の化け物とどのような関係があるのでしょうか……？":13,"\\n<経蔵>ここのバケモンの顔は、\nここの主人に似ている、ってことか。":14,"\\n<珠緒>犬が飼い主に似てくるのと同じかな？":15,"俊雄":16,"---------------------------------\n出現条件は、\nマーの治療＋珠緒の無事が確認できて以降":17,"\\n<経蔵>よう。ちょうどいいところにいたな。\\!\nそこでいい、動くなよ……？":18,"\\n<経蔵>何はともあれ珠緒が無事だったから、\nマーに続いてお前も治療することに決めた。":19,"\\n<経蔵>効いているなら、お前の親父から受けた\n暴力の思い出……ケガの痛みに関しては単なる過去の記憶、\nという感じになっているだろう。":20,"\\n<経蔵>俺だって驚いているんだ。\nまさか自分がお前らの治療をしようなんて発想を\n持とうなんてな。":21,"\\n<経蔵>マーに感謝しな。\\!\n生前ひどいめに遭って恨みは抱いていたものの、\n俺の知る限り、マーは誰かに直接危害を加えたことはない。":22,"\\n<経蔵>それで情けをかける気になれたってワケだ。":23,"\\n<経蔵>ま、飼い主のお前がいつも代わりに\n呪ってくれてたから、かもしれねえが。":24,"\\n<経蔵>伽椰子に伝えてくれ。\nおとなしく出てきてくれたら治療してやる、\\.\\.ってな。":25,"\\n<経蔵>抱えている身体の苦しみを取り去れば、\n呪う気持ちの一角を崩せる。\\!\n……さっき気づいたばかりだが。":26,"\\n<経蔵>情けも使いよう、\\.\\.かもな。\\!\n……呪いの連鎖と拡散を確実に止めるために。":27,"\\n<珠緒>……情け２割、作戦８割、ってとこ？":28,"\\n<経蔵>正確だな。\\!\nその２割も８割も、ついさっきまでなかった。\\!\nこれで結果が出るなら、ネコの力は偉大、\\.\\.だな。":29,"--------------------------------------------":30,"マー":31,"ラスト消灯":32},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map105","basename":"Map105.json","path":"data/Map105.json","relPath":"data/Map105.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":true,"progress":{"translated":33,"length":33,"percent":100},"cellInfo":[]},"data/Map106.json":{"data":[["EV001","","EV001"],["青","","blue"],["青位置設定","","blue position setting"],["--------------------\n■デバッグモード","","--------------------\n■Debug mode"],["--------------------","","--------------------"],["貞子ついてくる","","Sadako comes with me"],["--------------------------------------------\nひろし１人で入ると貞子がしれっとついてくる。\nひろしがスタート時点ですでに貞子に\n呪われているという伏線。","","--------------------------------------------\nWhen Hiroshi enters alone, Sadako follows him.\nHiroshi has already become Sadako at the start.\nA foreshadowing that it is cursed."],["--------------------------------------\n最初の青鬼のときにこの部屋に入ると\n貞子が（ターゲットを確保するために）\n青鬼を追い払う","","--------------------------------------\nIf you enter this room during the first blue demon\nSadako (to secure the target)\ndrive away the blue demon"],["----------------------------------------","","----------------------------------------"],["ラスト消灯","","Last lights out"]],"context":[["Map106/events/1/name"],["Map106/events/2/name"],["Map106/events/3/name"],["Map106/events/3/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map106/events/3/pages/0/list/7/comment"],["Map106/events/4/name"],["Map106/events/4/pages/0/list/1/comment"],["Map106/events/4/pages/0/list/17/comment"],["Map106/events/4/pages/0/list/76/comment"],["Map106/events/5/name"]],"tags":[null,null,null,["blue"],["blue"],null,["blue"],["blue"],["blue"]],"parameters":[null,null,null,[{"headerIndex":0,"headerParam":["--------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":7,"headerParam":["--------------------"]}],null,[{"headerIndex":1,"headerParam":["--------------------------------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":17,"headerParam":["--------------------------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":76,"headerParam":["----------------------------------------"]}]],"indexIds":{"EV001":0,"青":1,"青位置設定":2,"--------------------\n■デバッグモード":3,"--------------------":4,"貞子ついてくる":5,"--------------------------------------------\nひろし１人で入ると貞子がしれっとついてくる。\nひろしがスタート時点ですでに貞子に\n呪われているという伏線。":6,"--------------------------------------\n最初の青鬼のときにこの部屋に入ると\n貞子が（ターゲットを確保するために）\n青鬼を追い払う":7,"----------------------------------------":8,"ラスト消灯":9},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map106","basename":"Map106.json","path":"data/Map106.json","relPath":"data/Map106.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":true,"progress":{"translated":10,"length":10,"percent":100},"cellInfo":[]},"data/Map107.json":{"data":[["EV001","","EV001"],["-----------------------------------------","","-----------------------------------------"],["\\n<経蔵>（いまの部屋、誰かいるな。\\!敵ではなさそうだが……）","","\\n<経蔵> (There's someone in the room right now. \\! It doesn't seem like they're the enemy though...)"],["青","","blue"],["青位置設定","","blue position setting"],["--------------------\n■デバッグモード","","--------------------\n■Debug mode"],["--------------------","","--------------------"],["表貞子","","Sadako Omote"],["------------------------------------\nベストエンドのためのヒントを\n表貞子（リング０で登場）が教えてくれる。","","------------------------------------\nTips for the best ending\nSadako Omote (appeared in Ring 0) will tell you."],["\\n<経蔵>あんた、何モンだ。気配を抑えているようだが。","","\\n<経蔵> What the hell are you? It seems like he's suppressing his presence."],["\\n<経蔵>貞子と気配が似ているが、\n敵意のないやつをどうこうする気はない。\\!\n話をさせてくれ。","","\\n<経蔵> She looks similar to Sadako,\nI have no intention of doing anything to someone who isn't hostile. \\!\nLet me talk."],["\\n<経蔵>……そうか。\\!あんたがもともとの……\nバケモンでない、生前の……\\.\\.人間としての貞子か。\\!\n……生まれつき、バケモンに取り憑かれていたとはな。","","\\n<経蔵>...I see. \\!You were originally...\nNot a monster, but Sadako when she was alive... \\.\\. as a human? \\!\n...I never thought I'd been possessed by monsters since birth."],["\\n<経蔵>もとのバケモンがあんたの姿を取り入れ、\nさらに、恨みつらみを始めとした\nあんたの負の人格と合体したのが、\n","","\\n<経蔵>The original monster has adopted your appearance,\nFurthermore, starting with grudges,\nCombined with your negative personality,"],["\\n<経蔵>いまの……\\.\\.バケモンとしての「呪いの貞子」か。","","\\n<経蔵> Now... \\.\\. Is it the \"cursed Sadako\" as a monster?"],["\\n<経蔵>……ひとまず、信じてやる。","","\\n<経蔵>...For now, I'll believe you."],["-----------------------------------\nメモを所持してるときは\nワンアクション多い","","-----------------------------------\nWhen you have a memo\nMany one actions"],["\\n<経蔵>……このメモが、なんだって？","","\\n<経蔵>...What is this memo?"],["\\n<経蔵>『“解く力”を込める』って、どういうことだ、おい！！\\!\n……勝手に消えやがって。\\.\\.……ったく。","","\\n<経蔵> What do you mean by ``putting in the power to solve'', hey! ! \\!\n...It just disappeared on its own. \\.\\....Taku."],["\\n<経蔵>……要は、このメモのナゾナゾを\n解いてくれ、ってことか。\\!\n面倒ばかりよこしやがって。\\!どいつもこいつも……","","\\n<経蔵>...The bottom line is this memo's riddle.\nDo you mean, please explain? \\!\nYou're just causing trouble. \\! Who is this guy..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>目の前の空間に違和感を感じるのは\nなぜでしょうね……？","","\\n<\\N[2]>I feel uncomfortable in the space in front of me.\nI wonder why...?"],["EV005","","EV005"],["ラスト消灯","","Last lights out"]],"context":[["Map107/events/1/name"],["Map107/events/1/pages/0/list/11/comment"],["Map107/events/1/pages/0/list/15/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map107/events/2/name"],["Map107/events/3/name"],["Map107/events/3/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map107/events/3/pages/0/list/7/comment"],["Map107/events/4/name"],["Map107/events/4/pages/0/list/2/comment"],["Map107/events/4/pages/0/list/8/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map107/events/4/pages/0/list/11/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map107/events/4/pages/0/list/22/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map107/events/4/pages/0/list/26/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map107/events/4/pages/0/list/31/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map107/events/4/pages/0/list/38/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map107/events/4/pages/0/list/42/comment"],["Map107/events/4/pages/0/list/46/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map107/events/4/pages/0/list/53/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map107/events/4/pages/0/list/57/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map107/events/4/pages/0/list/83/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map107/events/5/name"],["Map107/events/6/name"]],"tags":[null,["blue"],null,null,null,["blue"],["blue"],null,["blue"],null,null,null,null,null,null,["blue"]],"parameters":[null,[{"headerIndex":11,"headerParam":["-----------------------------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":15,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],null,null,[{"headerIndex":0,"headerParam":["--------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":7,"headerParam":["--------------------"]}],null,[{"headerIndex":2,"headerParam":["------------------------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":8,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":11,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":22,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":26,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":31,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":38,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":42,"headerParam":["-----------------------------------"]}],[{"headerIndex":46,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":53,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":57,"headerParam":["spiritualists",0,0,0]}],[{"headerIndex":83,"headerParam":["N2",0,0,0]}]],"indexIds":{"EV001":0,"-----------------------------------------":1,"\\n<経蔵>（いまの部屋、誰かいるな。\\!敵ではなさそうだが……）":2,"青":3,"青位置設定":4,"--------------------\n■デバッグモード":5,"--------------------":6,"表貞子":7,"------------------------------------\nベストエンドのためのヒントを\n表貞子（リング０で登場）が教えてくれる。":8,"\\n<経蔵>あんた、何モンだ。気配を抑えているようだが。":9,"\\n<経蔵>貞子と気配が似ているが、\n敵意のないやつをどうこうする気はない。\\!\n話をさせてくれ。":10,"\\n<経蔵>……そうか。\\!あんたがもともとの……\nバケモンでない、生前の……\\.\\.人間としての貞子か。\\!\n……生まれつき、バケモンに取り憑かれていたとはな。":11,"\\n<経蔵>もとのバケモンがあんたの姿を取り入れ、\nさらに、恨みつらみを始めとした\nあんたの負の人格と合体したのが、\n":12,"\\n<経蔵>いまの……\\.\\.バケモンとしての「呪いの貞子」か。":13,"\\n<経蔵>……ひとまず、信じてやる。":14,"-----------------------------------\nメモを所持してるときは\nワンアクション多い":15,"\\n<経蔵>……このメモが、なんだって？":16,"\\n<経蔵>『“解く力”を込める』って、どういうことだ、おい！！\\!\n……勝手に消えやがって。\\.\\.……ったく。":17,"\\n<経蔵>……要は、このメモのナゾナゾを\n解いてくれ、ってことか。\\!\n面倒ばかりよこしやがって。\\!どいつもこいつも……":18,"\\n<\\N[2]>目の前の空間に違和感を感じるのは\nなぜでしょうね……？":19,"EV005":20,"ラスト消灯":21},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map107","basename":"Map107.json","path":"data/Map107.json","relPath":"data/Map107.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":true,"progress":{"translated":22,"length":22,"percent":100},"cellInfo":[]},"data/Map108.json":{"data":[["EV001","","EV001"],["-----------------------------\nOPのみ暗転待機","","-----------------------------\nWaiting for the OP to go dark"],["青","","blue"],["青位置設定","","blue position setting"],["--------------------\n■デバッグモード","","--------------------\n■Debug mode"],["--------------------","","--------------------"],["自動イベント","","automatic event"],["-------------------------------------\n●画像の準備","","-------------------------------------\n●Image preparation"],["------------------------------------\n●ＯＰイベント","","------------------------------------\n●OP event"],["　……\\N[2]、\\!\n　……\\N[2]！！","","...\\N[2], \\!\n...\\N[2]! !"],["\\n<卓郎>いつまで寝てんだよ。","","\\n<卓郎> How long have you been sleeping?"],["\\n<美香>こんなお化け屋敷みたいなところで、\nよく熟睡できるわね。\\!\n心臓に鉄の毛でも生えてるの？","","\\n<美香>In a place like this haunted house,\nI can sleep well. \\!\nDo you have iron hairs growing on your heart?"],["\\n<たけし>脳味噌野郎に加えて、\n“スチールウールハート野郎”\\.\\.って、呼んでやろうか？","","\\n<たけし>In addition to the brain miso guy,\nShall I call you “Steel Wool Heart Guy” \\.\\.?"],["\\n<卓郎>ははっ。台所でないところも\nピカピカにできそうだな。","","\\n<卓郎> Haha. Even in places that aren't the kitchen\nLooks like it'll be shiny."],["\\n<\\N[2]>心配かけましたね。\nそろそろ帰りましょうか。","","\\n<\\N[2]> I was worried.\nShall we go home soon?"],["\\n<\\N[2]>夢……\\.\\.でしたか。","","\\n<\\N[2]>Dream...was it \\.\\.?"],["\\n<\\N[2]>私は自分の部屋で眠りについたはずですが、\nここはあの屋敷の一室……。","","\\n<\\N[2]> I should have gone to sleep in my room, but\nThis is a room in that mansion..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>万一、夢でないとするならば……。","","\\n<\\N[2]>If it's not a dream..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>\\C[1]１階への階段を降りて、\n降りた先の玄関（↓）から表に出る\\C[0]としましょう。\\!\n……出られるといいですが。","","\\n<\\N[2]>\\C[1]Go down the stairs to the first floor.\nLet's call it \\C[0], which comes out from the entrance (↓) after getting off. \\!\n...I hope I can get out."],["DiscardCharacter !$ao_takurou","","DiscardCharacter !$ao_takurou"],["DiscardCharacter !$ao_mika","","DiscardCharacter !$ao_mika"],["DiscardCharacter !$ao_takesi","","DiscardCharacter !$ao_takesi"],["-----------------------------------","","-----------------------------------"],["OP卓郎","","OP Takuro"],["OP美香","","OP Mika"],["ひろしのベッド","","Hiroshi's bed"],["ひろし寝る？","","Hiroshi going to sleep?"],["\\n<\\N[2]>もう１度目を閉じれば、\n自分の部屋で目覚めるでしょうか……？","","\\n<\\N[2]>If you close your eyes again,\nWill I wake up in my own room...?"],["玄関に向かう","","Head to the door"],["２度寝してみる","","Try sleeping twice"],["\\n<\\N[2]>………………………………。","","\\n<\\N[2]>………………………………."],["-------------------------------------------\nセルフスイッチＡがオンになるのは\n無敵時のみ","","-------------------------------------------\nSelf switch A turns on\nOnly when invincible"],["\\n<\\N[2]>いや、いま眠るのは、\n得策ではないかもしれません……。","","\\n<\\N[2]> No, I'm sleeping right now.\nIt may not be a good idea...."],["------------------------------------\nメモを持っているときは何も起こらない","","------------------------------------\nNothing happens when I have a memo"],["\nマットレスと敷きぶとんの間からメモが見つかった。","","\nA note was found between the mattress and the bedding."],["\\^","","\\^"],["ふとんを持っていく","","bring a futon"],["一呼吸おく","","take a breather"],["ふとんを調べるとイベント開始","","The event starts when you examine the futon."],["----------------------------------------","","----------------------------------------"],["\\n<珠緒>ちょっと。\nさっきまであんたが寝てたっぽいやつを使う気？\n気配が残ってるからすぐわかるよ。","","\\n<珠緒> Hey.\nAre you going to use the one you were sleeping on just now?\nI can tell right away because the presence remains."],["\\n<\\N[2]>ほかの部屋のものはどういうわけか、\nベッドに固定されたマットレスしかなくて。","","\\n<\\N[2]>For some reason, the things in other rooms are\nThere was only a mattress fixed to the bed."],["\\n<\\N[2]>すみませんが、脱出に有利な和室に\n持って下ろせそうなものはこれしか……","","\\n<\\N[2]>I'm sorry, but I'm in a Japanese-style room that's more convenient for escape.\nThis is the only thing I can bring with me..."],["\\n<経蔵>はい。\\.\\.この状況をわきまえない\nワガママな悪～\\.\\.い子には、\\!こわ～\\.\\.い鬼が……","","\\n<経蔵> Yes. \\.\\.I don't understand this situation\nSelfish evil~\\.\\. For an ugly child, \\! is scary~\\.\\. An ugly demon..."],["-------------------------------------------\n青鬼が部屋に入ってくる。","","-------------------------------------------\nAo Oni enters the room."],["\\n<珠緒>経蔵がそんな話するから！！","","\\n<珠緒> That's what Keizo says! !"],["\\n<経蔵>どこで空気読んでやがったんだよ……","","\\n<経蔵>Where did you read the atmosphere..."],["\\n<\\N[2]>やはり、その気になれば一瞬で近くに\n来れるということですか……！","","\\n<\\N[2]> After all, if you feel like it, you can be nearby in an instant\nDoes that mean you can come...!"],["\\n<経蔵>（サシじゃ貞子や伽椰子同様、勝ち目はねえ……。\\!\nどうする……！？）","","\\n<経蔵> (Like Sadako and Kayako, there is no chance of winning with Sashi...\\!\nWhat should I do...! ? )"],["----------------------------------------\n部屋のテレビから貞子が現れる。","","----------------------------------------\nSadako appears from the TV in the room."],["-----------------------------------------\n貞子は青鬼に迫るも、あっさり青鬼に一飲みにされる。","","-----------------------------------------\nSadako approaches Ao Oni, but is easily swallowed by Ao Oni."],["\\n<経蔵>貞子をひと飲みだと！？","","\\n<経蔵> One drink of Sadako! ?"],["-----------------------------------------------\n青鬼の顔上半分が落ち、残った下半分側から貞子が。\nそのスキに一行は逃走","","-----------------------------------------------\nThe top half of Ao Oni's face fell off, and Sadako appeared from the remaining bottom half.\nThe group ran away because of this feeling."],["--------------------------------","","--------------------------------"],["\\n<経蔵>…………！！！！","","\\n<経蔵>…………! ! ! !"],["\\n<\\N[2]>経蔵さん！！","","\\n<\\N[2]> Keizo-san! !"],["\\n<経蔵>おっと、こういうときこそ逃げ時だったな！\n珠緒、背中にこい！","","\\n<経蔵> Whoa, this is the time to run away!\nTamao, come on my back!"],["\\n<珠緒>やむを得ないね！？","","\\n<珠緒>It's unavoidable! ?"],["\\n<\\N[2]>ここに青鬼がいるなら、\\C[1]玄関から！","","\\n<\\N[2]> If there is a blue demon here, \\C[1] come from the entrance!"],["\\n<経蔵>\\C[1]出られるな！！","","\\n<経蔵>\\C[1] Can't come out! !"],["\\n<経蔵>\\あばよ！！","","\\n<経蔵>\\Abyo! !"],["\nメモを手に入れた。","","\nI got the memo."],["イベント伽椰子","","Event Kayako"],["経蔵","","Sutra"],["珠緒","","Tamao"],["イベント青","","event blue"],["青の頭","","blue head"],["貞子の出るテレビ","","TV with Sadako on it"],["貞子","","Sadako"],["ラスト消灯","","Last lights out"]],"context":[["Map108/events/1/name"],["Map108/events/1/pages/0/list/2/comment"],["Map108/events/2/name"],["Map108/events/3/name"],["Map108/events/3/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map108/events/3/pages/0/list/7/comment"],["Map108/events/4/name"],["Map108/events/4/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map108/events/4/pages/0/list/9/comment"],["Map108/events/4/pages/0/list/13/message/noPicture/top"],["Map108/events/4/pages/0/list/21/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map108/events/4/pages/0/list/23/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map108/events/4/pages/0/list/27/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map108/events/4/pages/0/list/30/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map108/events/4/pages/0/list/43/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map108/events/4/pages/0/list/61/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map108/events/4/pages/0/list/77/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map108/events/4/pages/0/list/81/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map108/events/4/pages/0/list/85/message/hasPicture/bottom"],["Map108/events/4/pages/0/list/97/Plugin Command"],["Map108/events/4/pages/0/list/98/Plugin Command"],["Map108/events/4/pages/0/list/99/Plugin Command"],["Map108/events/4/pages/2/list/33/comment"],["Map108/events/5/name","Map108/events/7/name"],["Map108/events/6/name"],["Map108/events/8/name"],["Map108/events/9/name"],["Map108/events/9/pages/0/list/0/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map108/events/9/pages/0/list/3/Show Choices/3/1from2"],["Map108/events/9/pages/0/list/3/Show Choices/3/2from2"],["Map108/events/9/pages/0/list/46/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map108/events/9/pages/0/list/58/comment"],["Map108/events/9/pages/0/list/61/message/hasPicture/top"],["Map108/events/9/pages/1/list/2/comment","Map108/events/9/pages/3/list/2/comment"],["Map108/events/9/pages/1/list/7/message/noPicture/top","Map1